<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide Job hakwak nzwa pezi teulu, pa masang nah mahei süt. Pa pema pelane teinggah di nah mateei süt kelu caide, Job au pa Tinggwang de hung kela ha ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide ga dai ziemne keherei bi kecu keteu gai, keraide Tinggwang de hung kelame nah keyime dai ziemne ainzwa dibi kecu. Job zangmedung pa au pemau ziemne saja ngau eh reibam liedi. Job pa magede teumau süt kedi gahlie rang bidi nah pa Tinggwang de nlum kebam ha ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pecai Tinggwang marang gai nah pe kengkieng kedide keulia gai. Job kekamle Tinggwang au dizu nah miswagah nah anui cicang gailak lie ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Pecaile ha (1:1-3:26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Job pe zangme hangcum de ngngwa marang kecu (4:1-31:40)</para>
  <para style="io2">Tinggwang penai Job rei dai nzwabi? (4:1-14:22)</para>
  <para style="io2">Kenlienme keherei muila ni? (15:1-21:24)</para>
  <para style="io3">Job kembai mau lani? (22:1-31:40)</para>
  <para style="io3">Elihu samrang (32:1-37:24)</para>
  <para style="io3">Tinggwang marang kegai (38:1-41:34)</para>
  <para style="io3">Kekambe (42:1-17)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Uz namdi deu cika mige la pezi Job; nah Job au kemmau gede gah nah mzui, pa Tinggwang mie hingla nah kesia gade nreu tetdi kelame ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:8">Job 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Pa pe na mipeina hanghena nah mipuina hangcum bamla. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Pe mahei meurün canghena, ut cangcum, hetumseu zura haimengei, gada lei haimengei nah pe kilamedung kekiee ge bamla. Pa au Jordan reuki tingnaimiak kepetle de mina pelane dade heitume ge. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Pe napeimedung pe nlia tei eh, pe ki gage taktyei ngyi kai beula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taktyei ngyi kai beula </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide mna kelu tingba suiyi mnei kecude de rangbam lubui.</char></note>. Penui time hangcum de penuide ngngwa matyei nah sak kera mide langgai eh qula. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Taktyei tingba ngyi cang kedi dau, Job penui ziemne langgai nah pa penuide ratak tei eh teimci la. Pa tingcang nuge cuhlu delwe pe namedung hangge ge ziemne keru recadung teigai la, kedanemene pa rang cu, “A name kemau tei nah Tinggwang de penui nlungdung gade reset de bamlu builu.” Job aide tei muila.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Job de kedei keraibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Ge Tinggwang namedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggimgwame</char></note> penuikatei RAMPAUBE dwaga gwang kecu benai, Satan de penuide ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage keteugai, “Nang dai gade gwang lano?” Ge Satan RAMPAUBE sam keligai, “Kideube ga rwa hui kela, nlüt mpet kela gade lie.” <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage ranggai, “Nang a kilabe Job de pie ncet lami? Kideu ga migede pa kenzwa gah kecu ziemne, kemmau ge de gah nah mina kemzuime ge, Tinggwang mie hing nah kesiabe gade nreutetdi kelame ge.” <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Ge Satan RAMPAUBE sam keligai, “Job pekie kega gade Tinggwang mie hing lani?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Keu. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Nang pecu, pe ki, nah ma pelane twagwa kebamdung de rie gum pwabam meni? Nang pe bata leunedung samlam beula, nah pe kauruine kideu ga puilu. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Dede magade n ba hetwa mpet gai delwe pe da makebam pelane keugi dicai, pielo pa n dwa gade ncu reset dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Keu. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage ranggai, “Ainie, peda ma pelane kebamdung n ba ga kengkieng bam da. Dede nang pecu mmau eh pe reu gage n ba kai so.” Ge RAMPAUBE dwa gade Satan tetdi.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Langnaige, Job napeimedung nah pe napuimedung cingtube pei ki gade matyei nah zau sak bam. <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Samgwame ge Job da gwang eh rang, “Ketumseudung luh puh bam nah gadadung au penui taiga ma peei tyei la. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Cidau Sabeanme mina kangge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sütketyeime</char></note> penuide ketang nah penuide keuteu tetdi. Kilamedung de liecai, penuide kingtie tün le teitsetdi. Ih rünne n dage paubeu kera paklu.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Pa marang bam kecu dau, keda ge de gwang eh ranggai, “Tinggwang mi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hegikei</char></note> tinggim gade cakmie eh meuründung nah kilamedung de ru nggah ciak dida, Ih rünne n dage paubeu kera paklu.” <verse eid="JOB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Pa marang bam kecu dau, keda ge de gwang eh ranggai, “Chaldeame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chaldeame </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hemaa aide kerega maa ge auzie, Job lungh kebam deu nreule gade gwangkela maa ge auzie.</char></note> hemaa kecum teilwe, utdung de gwa ketang, nah penuide teu tetdi. Kilamedung de liecai, penuide kingtie tün le teitsetdi. Ih rünne n dage paubeu kera paklu.” <verse eid="JOB 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Pa marang cang kemakne, keda ge gwang dai eh ranggai, “N napeidung nah n napuidung cingtube pei ki gade matyei nah zau sak bam. <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />Hetaideu gade tingkai ngkieng süt kecu gwang eh ki tu mdai gage beu gai. Cide penui reu ga cakmie, nah penui tsaidi. Ih rünne n dage paubeu kera paklu.” <verse eid="JOB 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Ge Job cuhlu, pe suisia eh pe paini hietdi, pe peu taidi, hangdeu ga pe zu ngkum mie zeudi, nah Tinggwang dage hap eh kekie tei recadi. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Pa rangdi, “Ih a pui pok gade kempet dau mta eh gwang, nah Ih mta eh tetdai zie. Cide RAMPAUBE ne peu, nah cide RAMPAUBE ne keuteu dai dida. Peu RAMPAUBE zi de samlampung kelube teilo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:15">Kel. 5:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Ma aidung pelane gade de, Job kemau teidi ma, mede Tinggwang de mmau eh rang msia dima.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Job de kedei kenabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Ge Tinggwang namedung penuikatei RAMPAUBE dwaga gwang kecu benai, Satan de cika pekatei pecu RAMPAUBE dwa gage kai kerane penuide nzang eh gwangla. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage keteugai, “Nang daiga de gwang lano?” Ge Satan RAMPAUBE sam keligai, “Kideube ga rwa hui kela, nlüt mpet kela gade lie.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage ranggai, “Nang a kilabe Job de ncet piemi? Kideu ga migede pa kenzwa kemmau ge de gah nah mina kemzuime ge, Tinggwang mie hing nah kesiabe gade nreutet di kelame ge. Nang acu saumau beu eh peu pecu renia liede, pekie ga eh pecu ngkap di kera tei de, pa cude lungsang eh sap mtip bam.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:8">Job 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Satan RAMPAUBE sam keligai, “Pegeu ziemne pegeu, kesang; mige pe teilung ziemne pe da kebam pelane peu dizie. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Dede nang cu n ba hwagai eh pe ra nah pe ci tung gailo nah pielu pa ndwa gade ncu reset dizie.” <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />RAMPAUBE Satan dage ranggai, “Pielu, Ih ncu pecu tung kera peu dida; dede pe keringria au tung lak.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Iciu eh Satan RAMPAUBE dwa gade tet nzia di. Pa Job dage mazam teeisüt kecu pe pideu gade pe peu kecang teigai. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Job li pang kecube le pekatei pecu kwa, nah pa mimangbüt sum kakga ntum bamdi. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Ge pe nau pe dage rangdi, “Nang cude n kenlum de keuntip bam zie reuni? Tinggwang de resetdi eh tsai dilu.” <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Dede pa pe dage rang eh, “Nang mipui kemie pui ge marang kecu nzwa rang bam dida. Anui Tinggwang dade makeyi be ngau lula nah makesiabe luulu lakni?” Aidung pelane gade, Job au pe muileu gade kemau teidi ma.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Job zangme hangcum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Cidau Job zangme hangcum makesia aidung pelane pe da gwang kebam siulu, penui hangge ge pekatei pebam riep gade gwang: Temanmepei Eliphaz, Shuahmepei Bildad, nah Naamahmepei Zophar. Penui peting riet lwe pecu ngngwa lungrei mzi eh pelung taumla kera mteilu. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Penui kemdei ga kela dau ngang cuh piegai ge, penui Job de cilu tadi. Penui suisia eh hapdi, penui hangge ge penui paini hiet nah rebui tingkai gage nah penui katei penui peu gage kelien gai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30">Eze. 27:30</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 27:31">31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Iciu eh penui tingba nah tingmuizie lang henane pecu ngngwa bam. Migede sam rang pecu resiu ma, penui pe lungrei diham kedi ngau kecune.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Job makerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Aipaucai, Job marang eh pecu mna kelu tingba de de resetdi.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Pa rangdi,<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Peu acu mna kelu tingba de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">‘Mipeina gede tetlak luda,’ de eh rang kecu be ziu de gah di lulo.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Cipau tingba de peu muiting dilo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">nreule kebam Tinggwang de peu cide nsung diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">mede peu tingnaimiak cika ge taugai so.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Kemui nah ketsaimie de peu penui gudi lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">Hemwa de peu cika himgum dilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">peu tingbazie de ma pelane de heneutit delwe mui remang dilu.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Cipau tingmuiziu de peu, kemui de le zimcim dilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">Cipau tingba de pe mmi kakgade peu pei dai so;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">Hekei ziedung kepei gade cide peu gwang dai diso.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Pielo, cipau tingmuiziu de peu mta dilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">cika peu suiyi gwang ta dilu.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Leviathan de dainzwa ngkia ncuh ziebi ci kebammedung de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">peu cipau tingbazie de reset dilu.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Peu tingba ra hegidung de mui dilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">Cipaunai kebaa ziemne peeilu, dede magede peu ngau so;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">mede cide peu tingcang kebaa de ngau so,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />acu mna kelu ziu cide de reset dilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">kedanemene cide a miakngau gade keherei kebailu kemakne.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Daitei Ih henabam gade mpet kecu dau tsaidi meno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Daitei Ih a pui acu pung kela dau tsai di meno?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Daitei acu a pui mnie gage pwa no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">Daitei eh a pui tung le acu nepam kera peu no?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Cu Ih ziune eh zeu bam zie nage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">Ih ziep nah mtak bam dizie de nage.<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />Kideu ga hegwangme nah keledeume de ngngwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">penuikatei ziemne tei kelu heraudung cu kap dida.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Mede hegwangnadung piage kecak nah rangkanggeu le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">penui ki teipui kebamme de ngngwa zeu bam dizie.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Mede acu tsai eh mnalu liecai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">ngienadung kebaa ngau mezing kecume nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Cikade kesiame kehebwak kam dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">nah cika leu kebamme mtak lula.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Hebaangme kecang de lungciep ngau lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">penui kila kezeu kelame kwa siu lama.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Mina kedime de nah keceume de cika bamla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">cika kilame au pe mpaume dade pe suira tei lula.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Daitei mina helung keherei kebamme dage kebaa kaibeu zeu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">Daitei keherei kebamme de keringria kai beu zeu no,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />mige ketsai gwang kemakne cide regui kelabe de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">pa mahei kebaipwa kenzeu de swade ketsai penui sui la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Keu. 9:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Daitei eh mige pe sui yicangsiak kela ge de kebaa kaibeu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">nah herau ngau kelu dau pe sui yi lano?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Daitei eh kebaa pwa mina pe lampui kebai kedime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">mina cipaude de Tinggwang ne gumpwa bam ni?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Maketyei nding gade Ih hap pet dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">a mra kwa au dui rui mpet kegai nzwa da.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Kedanemene Ih ma hingham kebamdung a da gwang dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">nah Ih dai ngau hing la bi a da gwang dida.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Ih au relui meda, Ih au ziune meda, nah Ih kemtak gah da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">meliene keherei gwang dida.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Eliphaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Ge Temanmepei Eliphaz sam keligai,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Magade mige ncu ngngwa resiu kera teicai, nang n rata di zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Dede caune sam kerang pekatei pecu kam lubui no?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Pielo, nang mina kekiee ge de ledeu beu da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">nang kemnei badung tei ngkieng beu da.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Kaumie di zeu kecume de n sam le ngha beu da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">nang kemneime de tei ngking beu da.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Dede cu keherei n da gwangla dida, nah nang leu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">cide ncu tunggai, eh nang keherei dida.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Nang Tinggwang miekehing de ga n kekuu la meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">nah n lampuidung masang kecu n keregui gah dini?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Aide cet gailo, kehereide: makesangme cauge kekap dau no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Mede daidau mina petauketeime de gidi lano?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ih ngau kegai rehi gade au, kesiabe puh kegaime</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">nah keherei ling kegai cide rum zie.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Tinggwang ngngi kegai gade penui kap eh gah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">pe rata rahang ge nzwa eh penui de tei nggah dila.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Hingho mra kebam, hingho mrung kwa de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">kehena hinghodung gei, cidungde cum dida.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Hingho cing kedibe ma tuityei kera gah eh kap gah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">penui namedung pelane ga zangra dila.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Cu mage ngkiem eh a da teugwang gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">nah cipau ha de a kwen gage cüt gai.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Ge tingmui mangngaudung gade kecetdung gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">minadung zip zing mie kedi dau.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Tingmui dau kengngi nah kembeu cide a reu ga gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">nah a radung pelane mbeu di.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Iciu eh rabe ge a dwa gade tet kahdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">nah a pumteih mai cuhdi.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Rabe de sap jüja bam, dede Ih pe rehi ci ntsam siakte gai lak di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">A miak dwa ga marehi ge au bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">cika zingde kecu bam, nah Ih marang kecu kwa ge siu,<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />“Tsaidi kela minabe Tinggwang swade masang ki ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Mige pecu tei kegaibe swade mci ki ni?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Pielo, Tinggwang pe kilame de nlumlu mecai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">magade pe tinggimgwame de me lie eh mmau la cai,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />daikenzwa kiee ge de aide kesang no lidei kidung ga lungh kebamme ziemne au,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">pe bangdwa rebui ga kebamme de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">taklei swade penuide tei kecai mzetdi kelame de?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Tingcang penai tinghegi kakgade penuide tei ngkap dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">penui de migede ngau siakte mene kelungta penuide ngkap dila.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Penui paiki riadung penui kakgade ram gi dila meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">Penui tsai dila; penui da maci gah eh tsai dila.<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Cu qu gailo; cika migede nsam keli beu kera bamni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Kemcime cauge da nang nreugwang zie no?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Kedanemene rata kemieme de teitset dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">riaksiet mriak kemakme de teitset dila.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Kemieme ge kwak kebam nzwa Ih ngau da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">dede Ih pe ki reset zette dida.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Pe namedung kwaklu kera gade mdei süt la dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">penuide namdi kirie gade tei kecai dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">Cika migede penuide kelilu kera gah.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Mina kemzeume ne penui meidung tyei lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">hetudung kakga mei kebambe kecang de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Penui maheidung ziemne hereu kemzeu tei.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Kedanemene keherei kecudung au tangdei gade mpet lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">mede hangdeu gade kehebwak pet lama.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Meliene, minadung au keherei kerane lungh gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">mitsi limcuh kela nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Dede a ziemne au, Ih Tinggwang rünne dage nreu gai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">Ih a reidung pecu nlum pwapeu dizie,<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />pa makedi nah ma peicanggai kelakdung teigai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">miswagah süt kecu pei kapgai kelakdung.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Pa kideu gage tingrui peula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">nah luhdung gage dui kai beula.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Pa aide tei kegai mina kehenahme de kecehu gage kai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">nah hei eh hap kelame de peu kwaklu kerane,<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Pa mina heciem kesia riem keludung teipang dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">iciu eh penui batadung gade kemnung ngau melu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Tinggwang mina makecime de penuikatei penui ciem kesia bata gage tuigai dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">mina nlüt mpet kela mariemdung au cang mzet dila.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Penui tingkebaa ting ga kemui daula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">nah tingna de cide tingmui nzwa kemietla.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Dede pa au makegahme de ketsai gade keli lula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">nah kemneime de mina kengkiengme ba gade kelibeu la.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Cine makegahme ge keregui bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">nah masang kemakme pemui ngkui di maisia.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Pielo, Ngkiengtube Tinggwang ne ledeu beu kelabe de au samlam pungtu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">ciziemne, ncu kesui kegai dau mlai diso.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Kedanemene pa tei rezam gai nah kangdai dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">pa tei rezam gai nah pe ba le teingkei beula.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Pa au keherei kecu pia herok gade ncu kelibeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">kesang, keherei pia hena gade de, makesia ncu tung lak.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Herakum kegwang dau pa ncu ketsai gade keli luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">nah reutak dau ketsai gade ncu gum luzie.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Kenret kendam gade ncu kebai beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">nah kengkap cide kegwang dau de nang ngngi dilak.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Nang herakum nah kengkap de nuineu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">nah nang kideu ga teikuudung de hinglak.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Kedanemene n luh ga tangtsudung de ngngwa nang samkak tei luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">nah n luh ga teikuudung de ngngwa kezuyi bam dizie.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Nang n paiki kwak bam lie kecu ci zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">nang n meurün hau de pie gwang nah nang magede gah dilak.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />N leuhme dilu kerade nang ci luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">n leuhmedung au hangdeu ga ceheidung nzwa dizie.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Nang cing cangsiak dide n rau ga gwang dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">peting cide gwang ge meibui kidung meulu kela nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Pielo, ma aidungde anui peei eh pie da; cide ainzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">cide kingneilu, nah cide n katei cilu.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ge Job sam keli eh rangdi,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Oh, a keteei reidung de mdetlu liecai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">a kekap pelane riangteukwak gage kaigai liecai!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Cu ziemne au cidungde jaaidi ga heciangdung swade rüt gwa dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">Cide ziemne a samdung au kemta samdung.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Kedanemene Ngkiengtube Tinggwang lakpitsidung ada bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">a rabe heiring sak luda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Tinggwang gu ngaukehingdung keswa pwa ket cai ket eh acu renia dida.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Renaam gada ge peda cehei bam liede keregui gah eh mra bam zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Mede ketumseu ge pe tak cide tyei kebam dau mzeu mtei di lani?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Pe nggum kegahbe cauge mcai kaisi mene tyeilu buino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Mede nruibum keha cide pe nggum kesadung ge bam ni?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Ih cidungde tung kera mlai di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">cidungde a ziemne kemneu taktyei kenzwa ge.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Oh, Ih kekie de ngaulu liecai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">oh, Tinggwang Ih ma luuneu keladung teipwa acu peu liecai:<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Tinggwang cide pe lungning eh acu piage tei kecai di lubui lie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">iciu eh pa pe ba ketwa gai eh aipau teilung gade acu teitset dilie cai!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Aide le peu a lung nciep bamlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">Ih keteei gade a lung ngkieng lu liede cide tei ncam di gailak:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">Kemci Tinggwang samdung de Ih mlaidi gailak.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />A kengkieng daikenzwa ge eh, cide mteilwe kwabam laino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Daipai agu kekambe ge bam eh, Ih a teilung tei mtie laino?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />A kengkieng tangtsudung kengkieng ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Mede a pumteih hetageu le teini?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Ih akatei acu ngha gai kelak au kesang de meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">nah maci de a dade keu tetdi kecude?<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Mige pa sia eh keherei kebam dau, pe zangme kesamsang keulia maisia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">Ngkiengtube Tinggwang de hing mene bam kedibe de de.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Dede a sinamedung au hetaideu ga reuceuna lwa kebam nzwa a dade masang ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">helaudung kemta gage lwa gai di kela nzwa,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Cidungde muiting bamla kedanemene buising penui reuga kebamne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">nah kedanemene buising le penui katei de hebai pwabam.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Penui lwapet kegaidau, penui gah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">cide lum kegaidau, penui bam gade lwa pak dila.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Mbeuhkela maadung lampui ga tet kegwang dau dui sak kera peeila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">penui hetaideu ga hui mie eh gah dila.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Tema namdi gade mbeuh gwangkela maadung dui cika peila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">Sheba maamedung keregui penui da la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tema aide Aqaba Duingwang petle-nkangle duijaai ge liela. (Isaiah 21:14; Jeremiah 25:23 gade de ngau lubui.)</char></note><verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Penui sui tadi kedanemene penui dui ngau bi luzie de cet kelane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">Penui cika mie, dede penuide cwadi.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Cu au nnui a zangmedung a dade magede ta dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">nnui Ih rei kebam zai de ngau eh ngngi bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Ih nnui dage, ‘Madungge acu peulo’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">mede, ‘Nnui mahei gade acu mapeu halo de kie ni’?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />mede, ‘A ngauraume ba gade acu keli beulo’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">mede, ‘Acu nimteu kelamedung ba gade ribeu lo kie ni’?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Acu ledeu beulo, ciude Ih ziune bam luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">Ih dai gade mau dibi acu peu ci lulo.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Samdung kesangbe au dai kenzwa ge de teei no!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Dede nnui rang renia kebam, dainzwa penui acu kesiu siakte bam no?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Keregui kegahme samdung pwa tingkai ge nzwa cet kecu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Nang a samdung mlai di kera cet lani?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Kesang, pepei kegahme na de ziemne nnui dacak teila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">nah heliketeime gunia nzwa n zangbe reu renia.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Cu, cine, keherei de acu pie gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">kedanemene Ih n dwade kenret laklu.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Ntak dilu, Ih n dade kiela; peu petau kemakge de n da tei diso;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">Kesang, ntak dilu, kedanemene Ih kesang ga bam kecu ziemne.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Nnui Ih nret au lie cet lani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Nnui Ih petau kemak gade petaube rang gai laklie cet lani?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Kideu ga mina pe kenaang bamla meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">Pe tingbaziedung au mige de tingba ziehi liteu kela nzwa meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:5">Job 14:5</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 14:13-14">13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Kilame ge ting kaugwang kera hengin cangsiak kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">pe zie liteu kelame ge pe mahi ziedung ziemne kwabam kela nzwa,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />iciu eh kei ge cai kei ge acu teipwa peu keherei gade lia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">a da keherei tingmuiziedung teu gwang beu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:31">Job 15:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Ih zeu kemie dau, Ih akatei a dage rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">‘Daidau Ih cuh zie debi nah daidau tingba di zieno?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Tingba pet kemaktane Ih au zeudet mlwet mpet bam la.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />A pumteih au tangseudung nah tangnia le gum pwabam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">mazamdung teeisüt nah sui di nah mring lwa pak bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:11">Isa. 14:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />A tingbaziedung au pai kedakme ge deikim swade mzet gwa dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">keregui ge de gah eh penui kahgwang dida.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Nsung gailo, Tinggwang, a teilung au cuingi nage rünne dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">a miak makeyi ngau si lakta.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Tinggwang, acu kengaube, acu ngau si lakta;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">Tinggwang acu pei lazie, dede Ih bamta dizie.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Hemwa himlwe ngau tadi kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">Cinzwa Sheol ga mie kedimedung gwang dai lakta.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Pa pe ki ga cailigwang si dai lakta;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">mede pe bam nidung gade pecu cidai gai lakta.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Cine Ih mlei tadi gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">a rabe keherei kedine Ih marang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">A lungka de teu Ih ncam zie.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Ih jaaidi mede neidi ge ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">nang a reu gage kekwabe ge kaipwa bam kecu?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Ih, ‘A zeu acu tei relui beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">nah a zeukam le Ih kencam tei ntak beuzie,’ de eh kerang dau,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />ge nang hemangdung ge le acu tei mrimla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">nah mangngaudung gade acu keheu dila,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />iciu eh Ih ngkak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">nah ketsai de kedet luzie a radung de peu yi eh kainzeu kecu swade.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Ih a teilung ngkau dida; Ih lung bammui kecu luu neu ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">acu püt dilo kedanemene a tingbaziedung kemta kecune.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Daitei eh nang mina de mzai maisia no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">nang n lung kai pwa pe dage kai maisia kecu,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />nang tingcang ramsang pecu mcet muila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">nah tingba ramsang pecu kedei lano?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Nang a dade nreu tet kedi dwa dai tingtie ge zie no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">nang peu Ih rünne kedi dwa ketie ge acu peu akatei a mcai mnwa mie meno?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Ih kemau tei di liede, n dage daipai teigai zieno, nang mina de kwa bam kelabo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Daitei nang acu mcau zeu no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">iciu eh n ziemne Ih hepüt kerüt ge meni?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Daitei nang Ih teimau kedi de a mau gibeu meno nah Ih kesia ketei de keugi di beu meno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Ih cu tie mene rebui ga zeu mie dizie da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">nang acu peei teune zie, dede Ih bam si lakta.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Pecai Shuahme pei Bildad keligai,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Dai tiege nang aidungde rangbam zieno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Dai tiege n samdung de tingkai kaidi nzwa bam laino?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Kengkieng Tinggwang kemzuibe tei li lani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Ngkiengtube kesamsang tei li lani?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />N namedung pe dage kemau teigai dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">pa penuide penui maudung gage kaidi kela, anui aide cibam.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Dede nang laikai tei eh Tinggwang de peei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">nah Ngkiengtube dage n nggia kiecai,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />Nang mci nah mzui bam cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">pa ncu teucuh beuzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">nah n bam petau gage teucuh dai beuzie.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Nang ndeu keludau ceu liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">teilung kekamle au keraidau swa lungh yigwa luzie.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Kehereide ndaa keraime dade keteu lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">nah anui paupaime ci kelu de gage nlungkai lu.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />(Anui teilung au dui nah magede cima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">kedanemene kideu ga anui teilung au tingkaumie ge nzwa.)<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Penui ncu ledeu eh ranglia lak ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">Penui mlung gade samrang gailak ni?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Tangnia si mene kiina lunghlu buini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">Dui si mene hekuu lunghlu buini?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Cidungde mdiakrei eh bam reu kecune nah dangtüt kemakne de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">keda bangdung dwa cidungde regui dila.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Tinggwang de nsungla kemakme au lampui cikenzwa ga la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">hezai tei kelame au keregui gah dizie.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Pe keregui au teipang dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">nah pe kenlum au tamriakpe ra nzwa nnei.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Pa pe ki ngngei lwe bam zie, dede cide au pecu ngha gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">pa cide herak luzie, dede cide au sap gailak.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Pa tingnaimiak dwa gade au mdiakrei eh bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">nah pe gurie pelane ga pekiakdung pet bam.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Pe mahdung tangtsudung peureu ga kop pung bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">penui heni keyi tangtsudung kakga bamla.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Dede magade cide pesap bam gade tei msia dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">heni cide pecu mlaidi eh rang zie, ‘Ih madaude ncu ngau ma.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Pielo, aide mige “pesuiyi” kelame zaireli ge;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">kedabe bangdung cipau tangdei de gade pe keleu lungh pet daila.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Pielo, Tinggwang au mina keyime de püt dilak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">mede kesiame de ngha lama.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Pa ncu suiyi le kepui tei beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">n muileudung le sah gai zie.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Ncu ngaurau kelame reu gage ngngam teugwang beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">iciu eh kenlienme paiki gah dizie.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Cipaucai Job keligai,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Ih aide ainzwa kecu kesangsiakpe ci.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Dede dainzwa Tinggwang dwa gade mige petau lie eh ranglu lai?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Magade pa Tinggwang de rang repia neula cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">pa pecu pecang gade piage de pe sam keli gailak.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Tinggwang au mteu nah ngkieng;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">cauge pecu renia eh saplu dino?—<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Pa pe rata kegaidau mide mrai rang nswa gai mene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">lamlwatudung tei mlai nah ngkap dila,<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />pa hangdeube pe bam gade teu kelai mpet dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">nah pe tsiadung de kelui gaila.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Tinggwang tingnaimiak de peu cuh helo de sam kaibeu eh, cide cuh lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">nah hegidung de gum kelabe de da,<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />pa pekatei tinggimdung teukam la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">nah jaaidi kenuak kegaidung kam dila,<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />pa Gibei, Hegikamca, Tialiangkileimena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">nah tingpile gidung teigai.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Pa ma kedidung nah pei gai kelakbedung teigai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">nah miswakegah batadung pei canggai kelakbe teigai.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Pielo, pa a taiga kah gwangla, nah Ih pecu ngau ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">pa tetkah gwang, dede Ih pecu cilu ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Pa mage keuteudi liede, cauge pecu kam lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Cauge pe dade, ‘Nang daitei au no?’ de keteu lulai.<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Tinggwang pe rata keu nli dilak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jaaidi kauna</char></note> de kenghame pe kangga keumie di.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Dai cam nage Ih pe sam keli lai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">pecu rang renia kera Ih samdung kedet lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Ih samsang liede, Ih pe sam keli gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">Ih a tuketiakbe dade a nggia rünne kie lubui.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Ih pecu qugai nah pa a sam keligai liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">pa a kwa kingnei bamlie kecu Ih nlum gailak.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Kedanemene pa acu rahang ge le teipang gai kelane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">nah pekie kegah gade a rezamdung tei nkiee beula.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Pa acu peu ngngi dai gailakdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">dede pa acu kekaa le kepui teibeu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Aide kengkieng gu ge liecai, ainie, pa au ngkieng!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Aide kemzui gu ge liecai, cauge pecu tutiak ki gage qugai lulai?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Ih mzui nah masang bam liede, Ih kerang de ne acu mmau zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">nah ada kemau ge de bam meliede, a samdung ne acu mmau dizie.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Ih kemau ge de gah, dede Ih akatei a teilung de ku meda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">Ih akatei a teilung de ngkau la.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Magede pe kentsam gah, cine Ih rangla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">Tinggwang mau kemakme nah kesiame de ngngwa ncüt delwe ngkap dila.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Kedap dene zette teitset dige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">pa kemzuime rei dede teu henui teila.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Tinggwang kideube pwa kenlienme de peu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Tinggwang tutiakme miak kezui dila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Cide Tinggwang ne teigai meliecai, caune teigai no?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />A tingbaziedung au pak kela samgwame swade mzet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">a tingbaziedung pak tetdi zeu; penui ma kehei gade de ma keyi kette ngauma.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Cidungde au liem mzettube nzwa da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">nah lingrie pe taktyei reuga simmie kecu nzwa mzet ge.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Magade Ih a ncamdung de nsungta dizie degai liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">nah Ih a sui kesia de gidi eh a sui yilu zie degai de,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />Ih a lungreidung de hing lazie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">kedanemene nang acu mzui lie de beu kelak Ih ci kebamne.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Acu mmau dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">cine, daitei, Ih kemta gage a lung naang bam lai?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Magade Ih akatei acu buising dui le duipia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">nah aba tei mcigi dide,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />Tinggwang acu hekwaki kecok gage keliengai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">nah akatei a painidung liede acu ngkau dizie.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Kedanemene Tinggwang au Ih nzwa mina ma, Ih pecu pe sam keligailu kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">nah tutiak ki ga anai gwang ncütlu kera.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Anai kakga migede tutiakme gah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">pe ba anai reu ga kailu kera.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />A dade Tinggwang saja keu mpetdi kera tutiakme keda ge de gah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">pe ratadung le acu keheu kera gade acu keu mbailu kera.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Iciu lucai Ih pecu hing mene rang zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">Dede cu ainzwa kebam dau, Ih cide tei gailak.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Ih lungh leu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Ih kencam ga nzaha eh rang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Ih a lungka le marang zie.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Ih Tinggwang dage rang zie, ‘Acu ntaku mmau di helo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">dai ziemne acu mmau labi ranglia lo.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Nang acu tei keherei kelade n ziemne kehega kecuge ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">nang tei kegaide mlaidi kera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">delwe kenlienme ciemdung de ga n sui bam kecu?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Nang pumteih miak bam ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">Nang mina kengau nzwa ngau ni?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />N tingba ziedung mina ziedung nzwa ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">Nah n mmidung de mina mmidung nzwa ni?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Iciucai nang daitei Ih kesia ketei pelane peei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">nah a mau pelane gwa eh peei lano,<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Ih maula kemak nang cibam liede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">migede acu n ba gade keli gailak.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />N ba le acu teilu nah kemuilu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">nah cu cipau ba de ne acu ngkap bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Nang acu tangdei le tei kelu nsung gailo, Ih kiela;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">nang acu tei kecai pwa rebui tei daidi zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Nang acu lungh lu kera kengkieng a pei de peu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">nang acu a pui za gade peu lungh cu lu.<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Nang a pum teigeu nah teihci le kezui lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">nah teiradung nah mneiriadung le tei ncütlu.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Nang acu kering nah samkak kelu samsang peuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">a rabe n kengha ne acu gumbeu da.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Dede nang aidungde n mlung ga kebai pwabam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">Ih cibam nang aidungde cet kebam:<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Ih kemau teigai cai, nang cilu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">Ih kesia tei kegai de nang a mau gibeu lak.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ih kemau tei dicai, ainie, ada keherei gwang zieda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">nah Ih samsang gai liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Ih a peu ngang cuh gailak di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">kedanemene Ih kengngam le pui pungbam di delu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">a reidung pie gailo! <verse eid="JOB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Ih a peu ngang cuh la cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">nang hingho ge nzwa acu gwazui miela;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">nah acu rezam gai kera nang miswakegah kengkieng batadung kecang de teila.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Nang acu mmau eh zierang keheci ngngwa gwang lula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">nah acu n rata de direureu cuhla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">nang acu gwaketang ciem keheci riem bam muila.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Daitei eh, Tinggwang acu peu apui za gade mnalu dino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Migede acu ngau kemakne ge Ih tsaidi neu dege.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Ih madau de lunghgwang kemak nzwa dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">apui za gade herau ga nzuigwang dizie dege.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />A teilung cangdi kera kecam nage melui ni? Mtaklu iciude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">acu peu akatei dilu, iciu eh Ih peting kiekemak nage mtaklu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Ih caili gwang dai kelak ga mie kedi dwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">kemui nah ketsai tingkaumie deu ga,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />muisum nzwa kemui deu ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">ketsai tingkaumie deu, kehebwak deu ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">cika kebaa liede muisum nzwa.’”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Zophar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Cidau Naamahmepei Zophar pe sam keligai,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />Sam kekiee cidungde keli beu kerabe meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Aipau pei de, marang pui kebam de de nlumlu buini?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Nang hegie kebam de ne kedamedung de peu mlei mene bam zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Nang mide rang msia kecudau, migede ncu tei ngngam di lak ni?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Kedanemene nang Tinggwang dage ranggai, ‘A kenlum au mci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">Ih n miakngau gade kemau ge de gah.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Dede, oh, Tinggwang de peu n dage maranggai eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">peu ncu ledeu beu neu da;<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />peu pecu maci kecuk de ncu keulia gailo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Kedanemene pe da maci kieesüt.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Tinggwang au n maudung ziemne ngaulu kebui swade cam eh ncu saja peula.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Nang Tinggwang de kepeei gade pecu ci lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">Nang ngkiengtube de ci cangsiak lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Aide au tinggim hu ge da; nang daipai teilu buino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Cide au Sheol swade cok; nang daipai cilu buino?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Pe ndet au kideu swade tie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">nah jaadi swade di.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Pa magade kahgwang eh keheibe de de baang dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">mede pa keheibe de tutiak gage qugai cai, cauge pecu kam lubui no?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Kedanemene pa kenretme de cila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">pa kemau ketei kengau dau, pa cide mcetla meni?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Renaam gada mina ge de mna lula kemak nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">kemieme au makecime ge tei gailak.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Dede nang n mlung mtei pwa bam eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">nang n ba Tinggwang dage hetwapet pwa bam cai;<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />cipau kemau ta de n ba ga bam liecai, nang n dade cide keu kemdei dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">nah n ramzeuki ga petaukemak ge de peu lungh diso.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Cidau n da hengam gede gah eh nang ngang cuh luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">kesang, nang n sap ntip luzie nah ngngi dilak.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Nang n reidung de nsungta dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">nang cide dui lwatet kedi be nzwa nsung gai eh ta dizie.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />N teilung au tingna kebaa swade baa ki zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">cika kemui bam de, cide tingcang nzwa dizie.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Cika keregui kebamne nang kwak luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">kesang, nang n da kwak kebam ngau luzie nah kwak kebam gade kemtak ngau luzie.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Mige ne de ncu keheu di mene nang mtak luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">nah, mi kekiee ge n ngha kie zie.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Dede kenlienme au ngkap dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">penui pak gai kera lampui gah dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">penui keregui au ketsai rünne dizie.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ge Job keligai,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Nnui minadung kesang da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">maci nnuide ngngwa tsai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Dede maci nnui da kebam kieege ada de bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Ih nnui swa sia ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Kesang, aidungde cikemak cauge bam no?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Ih au a kidame ziemne nui keneu ge dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">Ih, Tinggwang de qu kegaibe nah pa a sam keli beu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">Ih, masang nah kemau kegah pei ge, Cu au Ih nui keneu ge dida.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Keherei mene kebamme ge, keherei kelame de teu henui teila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">pa macet kecu ria gade kaumie dilai eh kebamme de peu keherei ngausi dai lula.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Dede sütketyeimedung ziune lungh lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">nah Tinggwang rata tei kelame kwak eh bam lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">penui katei penui badung au penui rabedung.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Dede cu renaam kaunedung de keteu lu, nah penui ncu ledeu beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">tinggimdung ga nruinedung de keteu lu, nah penui ncu ranglia beuzie.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Mede kideu de mpau lulo, nah ncu ledeu beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">jaaidi ga heka ncu ranglia mci beu zie.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />RAMPAUBE ba ne aidungde teigai lie kecu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">makaune aidung kakgade cau ci meno? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:20">Rom. 1:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ringkela leune teilung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">nah mina pelane cuingi pe ba ga bam.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Mi mleu taktyei nggum ci kela nzwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">mikwen de samdung siu la meni?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Kemteu de kecingme da bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">teilung ketie ga maci bam.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Tinggwang da maci nah kengkieng bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">pe da keledeusam nah kecikecet bam.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Pielo, pa teipang dila, nah cide au teidai gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">pa migede baang di liecai, cika au lung mpet dai kera gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Keu. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Pielo, pa tingrui kam dilie cai, hangdeu cangh dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">nah pa tingrui langgai lie cai, hangdeu pui nlim luzie.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Pe da kengkieng nah maci bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">mina ne cwa kedime nah cwa kelame hangnana de pe kengkieng ga bam.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Pa kedime de lungrei pui eh langgi dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">pa tutiakmedung de kemiemedung tei dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Pa hegwangmedung dade kengkieng keu gidi la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">pa penuide hebaangme ge tei dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Pa cingkumedung de lungrei pui eh lang gidi la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">nah mina kengkiengme de tei ngkau dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Pa mina nlum kelame sam keu gidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">nah kecingmedung maci keugi dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Pa hegwangnadung de kemta tei dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">nah mina kengkiengme kiakang hiak dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Pa kemui kecok ga kebamdung de keulia la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">nah kecok ga kebam tingkaumiedung de kebaa gage teugwang beula.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Pa heleuhdung tei ngkieng beu, nah pa penuide ngkap de dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">Pa heleuhdung tei mdi beula, nah pa penuide peu hebaangmedung de tei dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Pa kideu ga muiteumedung dade maci keuteu gidi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">pa penuide lampuiki kegah renaamkang ga peu hui la dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Penui kebaa gah eh kemui ga kemiet la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">pa penuide sak kemieme nzwa peu tet tanglia dila.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Pielo, a miak le aidungde ngau ciak da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">a kwen le siu da nah cilu da.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Nnui ci kebamde, Ih de cibam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">Ih nnui swa sia soma.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Dede, Ngkiengtube Tinggwang de Ih resiu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">Ih Tinggwang de ngngwa samlim neula.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Dede kesangbe de nnui kenret le ha dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">nnui au pemi kegah mide teikemmime .<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Oh, nnui pelane ngngwa ziune bamlu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">Cide le nnui maci zie.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />A kecet de kingneilo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">a nggia kie kegai de kingneilo.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Nang Tinggwang ziemne samsang kemak samdung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">nah mide cwa kela samdung pe ziemne rangbeu zieni?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Nnui pe lam pwa zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Tinggwang ziemne nnui hetiak tiak beu zieni?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Pa nnuide peei mpet kegaidau nnui ziemne yi zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Nnui mina de cwalu kela nzwa pecu cwa lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Pa nnuide kesiu bi zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">ngkim eh nnui milam kepwa zai tei dicai.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Pe kengkieng le nnuide keheu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">nah pe rata nnui reu ga gwang di lakni?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Nnui nsungbam kera samdung au mimüt le tei kelu macisamdung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">nnui kiriedung au lidei le tei kelu kiriedung.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Ziune eh peu akatei bamlo, iciu eh Ih maranglu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">a da dai gwang zie bi peu gwang lo.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Ih akatei acu kerehim gage kai luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">Ih a teilung akatei a ba gage kai luzie.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Pielo, Tinggwang acu teitset lie cai, Ih a keregui kette gah dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">iciuliede, Ih pe dwaga a mzeu rang zie.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Acu kelilu kera kie aide zie da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">kedanemene kenlienme migede pe dwaga gwang gailak.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Tinggwang, a samdung kingnei sunne gailo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">Ih rang ndu kegaidung de kingnei gailo.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Pielo cu au, Ih a mzeu be rang kera mtei luda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">Ih petau lie kecu Ih cibam.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Tutiak bam gade acu ngngwa renia kera cauno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Nang cide tei kera gwang eh, Ih mau delie lucai, iciu cai Ih zingde eh tsaidi luzie.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Tinggwang, a ziemne ma kena ge tei gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">nah Ih n dade mbai tadi zie:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />a dade n rata ba de keu nzia dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">nah n rata le peu acu tei ngngi tadi lu.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Pecai acu qugai lu, nah Ih keligai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">mede acu peu ncu resiulo, nah nang a sam keligai lo.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />A kesiadung nah a maudung dai kiee ge bam no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Ih teimau kedi be nah a mau peu acu ci gailo.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Daitei nang a dade nreu tetdi lano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">nah daitei acu n ngauraume ge nzwa pei lano?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Guigi kedi manei nage de nang tei keherei zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">Reigau kecangh ge de nang gwaketang zieni?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kedanemene nang kemau hungsüt kecu dungge pwa acu mmaula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">nang acu Ih henadau a kesiadung de peu gumdailu.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Nang a pi hegeuria le keulu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">a lampuidung nang pie teune bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">nah a pi tet kegai hangdeu de de nang pie teune bam<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ih ma timrim eh gahdi kelabe ge liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">paiheni taklei tyei kedibe ge nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Mipei, mipui dade lunghgwang kelube,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide pekie mnei</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">tingkak nage ziemne lunghla nah keherei le pui.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Hangdeu gade mapa ge pwak cuh nah dangtüt di kela nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">tingkaumie nzwa pakdi la nah bam tie lama.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Nang ma aidungde keheibe de piegai lani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">Nang acu tutiak gage ngngwa gai zieni?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Cauge ma kehera gade ma kemcibe keu mpet lulai? Migede ma.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Mina teilungh au mrai riem pwabam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">Pa lungh kera keidung riak au n da bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">pa lungh kera nangne riem pwabam nah pa cide nreu kahpet gailak.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Pecu peu ntak gai kerane pecu pie tadi lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">iciu eh pa tei lubui cai liteukelame ge nzwa eh peu pecu pe tingba gade renga eh pesuilu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Tsingbang ge ziemne keregui ge bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">cide de dang dicai, cide bwa pet dai lubui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">iciu eh pe kiak kerenunabe gah di kelakne.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Pe mah hangdeu gade cingdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">nah pemui hangdeu ga tsai zeudi liede,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />cide dui nghui gai kecu rünne liede, cide bwacuh zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">nah mabang ge nzwa pe kiakdung pet zie.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Dede mina tsaidi ge; pe kengkieng gah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">kesang, mina tsai dila, nah pecai pa daiga ladi no?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Rejaai gade dui gahdi kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">nah hereuki ga dui gahdi nah cangdi kela nzwa,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />cinzwa mina de tsai dila nah cuh dai lama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">Tinggimdung gah di kemaktane, penui nrak cuh dai lakta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">nah penui zip kezeu gade nrak cuh lakta.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Oh, nang acu kehereidung gade Sheol gage kebai di beu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">nah n rata de cangdi kemaktane nang acu kengkim ni gage kebai di kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">nah peting ge rietlu eh cika peu acu bamlu delwe acu nsung dailu lie cai!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Mige tsai dicai, pa ringdai lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Iciu cai, Ih keherei ting leune de cika kwabam neu lie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Ih kerelui ngau kemaktane.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Nang qugai zie, nah Ih ncu keligai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">Nang n bata de nsui luzie.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Nang a pikietdung peilu eh pie rengei beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">nang a maudung nsungbam lak.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />A maudung nsung gage baang dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">nang Ih tei mau kedi leune ha dizie.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Dede lamlwadung kau dila nah cidungde magede tadi la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">tsuradung de pe bam gade tei mlai mpet dila;<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />dui ne tangtsudung de dia gidi la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">duinai ne kideu gu rebui dia gidi la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">Ainzwa eh, nang mina keregui de ngkap dila.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Nang pe reu ngkieng mui lula, nah pa tetdi la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">nang pe zu tei ntsam dila nah pecu tsai kera lang gidi la.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Pe namedung de herüt peu liede, pa cide ci lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">nah penuide de teu henah di liede, pa cide ngau lama.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Pa pe pumteih teei kecude gwale cima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">nah pa pekatei pe ziemne hei eh hap la.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Eliphaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Pecai Temanme pei Eliphaz sam keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Iciu liecai makecime ge kemta maci teu sam keli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">nah naimiak kepetle tingkai le pecu pui eh bam zieni?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Pa pemi kegah resiu de ngngwa rang renia zie ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">mede samkerang kie pa cide le pwa makeyi tei lu gailak ni?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Meliene, nang Tinggwang de herüt tei ncam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">nang pecu kereca de pecu kam dida,<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />n maudung ne n mui de keledeu beu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">nang au nciem yi eh mide kemeu lu kelade ngu tei luda.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Nkatei n mui ne ncu mmau, Ih ne ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">kesang, n mui ne ncu ndulia nah mcau bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Nalung gade nang mina raitube deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Nang au kideutudung dwa de ladi deni?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Nang Tinggwang kengkim macidung siu deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">Nkatei n dage nang maci kezeu dila ni?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Anui ci kemakpe nang daige ci no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">Anui dade bam kemakbe nang daipai cilu laino?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Anuida au pe peu pu kedime de nah mina cingsüt kedime de bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">penui au n pei swade cinggwa dida.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Tinggwang lungciep de n ziemne cam ham dini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">sam kemnuadung n da kegwang de?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Daitei n mlung de peu ncu teu tetdi zeu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">Daitei n miak pieling bamno,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />iciu eh n rabe de peu Tinggwang de mcau eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">n mui gade sam cikenzwa petdi kera?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Mina keheibe de mci lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Mipui dade lungh gwang kelu keheibe de samsang lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Pielo, Tinggwang au kemcidung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggimgwame </char></note> de kecangde de nlumla kemak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">kesang, tinggimdung de pe miak gade au mci ma;<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />kerecie nah kemau tei kelame au daikenzwa ge de mci cangme ziebi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">mina kemau de dui nzwa sak kelame!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Ih nnuide pwalia zie; a kwa kingneilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">Ih n dage reci beu zie Ih ma kengaube,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />macidungde makecimedung penui peimedung tingdau de teugwang lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">cidungde penui paumedung kebai di kemakde.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Hangdeu aidungde penui paupaime deu, penuide rünne hangdeu peu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">nah penui kakga sangme migede tetkah gwang ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mina kesiame pe teilung zie pelane teei eh keherei la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">mide tei keherei kelame mmidung hekwa pwabam.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Siu kehing kwadung pe kwen ga lala;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">pa hei nah kehega kebamdau, kengkapbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">keregame</char></note> pereu ga gwang dizie.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Pa au kemui gade cailigwang dailu kera cet lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">kiengtie be pecu kwabam.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Tangku ziemne pa heni kekiee ga mie, pa rang eh, ‘Dai ga bam no?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">Kemuibe tingba de petaiga kebam pa cila.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Lungrei nah suisiet de de pa hingla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">aidungde ne pecu puipung eh, hegwang ge hereu ga lüt kera mtei teu kebamdau nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Kedanemene pa au pe ba hwapwa Tinggwang de kemcau ta teigai kedi ziemne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">nah Ngkiengtube dwa gade pe zai ngang cangsiak kedine,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />mina kesia aipaude au Tinggwang dage ngangdang delwe pakkai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">hegeu kesiuge teu eh.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Aide au kesang lei, pa au peca le pecu hampung pwabam liede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">nah pe za peca le hekwa pui pwabam liede,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />nah namdidung mina lungh kemak ga lungh liede;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">cu renam mina lung kemak kidung ga liede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">nah ralie le kepui teidi laibam kecu ga.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Pa au mahei gailak; pe mahei au bamtie lak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">nah pe mabam au pe deu gwa lebie pet gailak.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Pa au kemuibe de lamna swa gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">miheu ge ne penei bwanadung de gap ki dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Tinggwang mui gade kepet cui de ne pa au tet dizie. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew laisiu ga </char><char style="fqa">Pa au pe mui cui gade tet dizie,</char> de eh bam, dede keheci laisiudung kesa Greek kehegwa de nzui eh, <char style="fqa">pe pa tingkai gage gui nghai dizie. </char> </note><verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Pecu peu ma kemtabedung de nlum so, pekatei pecu cwa di eh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">kedanemene ma kemtabe le pwa pe ziehi dizie lu.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Pa tsai kerating gwang kemakne cide tei zie lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">pe kiak be au mdiak lulak.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Pa au kubebang petsi meu mene nghai di kelabe nzwa zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">olive bang nzwa pa pe pa tei gidi zie.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Nlumkemakme de ngngwa hemaa tei kelame pe leuh tei lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">hetau henim le ki tei kelube mi le ru dizie.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Penui mide tei kerejam tetlak pung lula nah makesia be mna gai beula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">penui kemaube tetlak lula delwe kemau mna beula henabam au mide kecwa tetlak lula.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Pecai Job sam keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Ih cikenzwa ma kekiee ge siu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">nnui au pelane milungrei peei kebeumedung lie.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Kemtasamdung de penli bam zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">N da daipai ge maubam dino cide nang n sam ainzwa keli kegai?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Nang nzwa Ih de rang lubui lie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">magade nang be a bam ga bam liecai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">Ih samdung peei hekwa lwe nah sam cidung teu ncüt lwe ncu renia lubui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">nah a peu kengak eh ncu henui tei lubui lie.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Ih a mui ge le ncu tei ngkieng luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">nah a muileu mlai delwe lungciep ncu teugwang beu zie!<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Ih marang liede, a lungrei au cam swa luma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">Ih marang mtakdi liede, dainzwa acu ngha lulai?<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Dede cu au, Tinggwang, nang acu tei pwa peu leu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">nang a kelak de teu tsamciak dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Nang acu peu ki dida, ainzwa kecu Ih akatei de acu ci dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">Ih ki kedi a pum aide acu renia cuh zeu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">nah a zu de renia kecu tei kelia ge dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Tinggwang pe rata le acu teurak dida nah acu tei keherei;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">pe rata le pe gei geigim bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">pa acu teurak kebam a ngauraume acu pe miak le pieling bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:16">Keh. 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Minadung acu twagwa lwe penui mui ngnga pwa bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">penui acu samdau lu kemakne a zu gage kepeu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">penui ngngwa ngkwalu eh acu renia dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Tinggwang acu pwa pecu cikemakme ba gage kai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">nah acu kelien pwa mina kesiame ba gage kaibeu.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Ih au mtak bam ge, pa acu tei pangpop dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">Kesang, pa a ngwang hekiplu delwe acu tei kecai dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">pa au acu tei kera kaa bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />Pe lakpi kekapme acu twagwa pwa bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Tinggwang a nkeu kui di nah pa acu de mbaibeu meda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">pa kideu reu gage a mau dui rui gai dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Pa a tangdeu gage dap daidai la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">pa reugwame ge nzwa eh a reu gage pak gaila.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Ih rosopai dakpwa acu halu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">Ih keumie hangdeu gage a kii kuipung bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Kehap ne a zu gierei bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">a miak kum ga ketsai mie la dida<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />matei kemsia au a ba ga gah liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">nah a kekie au mci liede.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Kideube, a jai gum di helo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">peu a kehap de kemtak bam gede bam so.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Cu kecangde, pielo, a lam sap kera au tinggim ga bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">a tu tiak beu kerabe au kecehu ga bam.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />A zangmedung acu mmau la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">dede a miakdui au Tinggwang dage lwagai bam.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Ih peu midungge de a ziemne Tinggwang dade kie neulie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">mige pe kidabe ziemne tei beu kela nzwa!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:35">Job 31:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Mmi kiee kemak ge gwang kedidau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">Ih caili dai kelak bam ga Ih gwang dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:21">Job 10:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />A rabe au penli dida, nah a teilung tingdung cang dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">herau be a ziemne mtei pwabam dida.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Kesanglie mide rangkemsiame acu ngngwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">penui mide rangkemsia a miak le ngaubam muila.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Sampet ge peulo, nkatei le a lam sap beulo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">cauge bam si reuno acu ngha kera?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />N ziemne, Tinggwang, penui mlung ma cilu kera gade kainzeu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">ciziemne, nang penuide peu a reu gade ngkieng diso.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Keheibe de pe zangme de ziehi mlai kedime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">pe name miak au ma ngau ta dizie.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Dede pa au acu teipwa mina samkie teibeu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">penui a zu gage mcai nsui gai.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />A miak liede a sui kesia dene ma ngau mcilu meda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">a pumteih pelane tingkaumie ge nzwa cip dida.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Masang kelame de aide ziemne penui swagahdi lauda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">kemcimedung penui cuh delwe nlum kemakmedung de renia lauda.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Petau tei kelame pe lampui be ga la luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">caugamme pe ba mci labi cipaume ngkieng si reureu luzie.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Dede nnui pelane ziemne au, cu gwanglu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">Ih nnui kakgade makecime ge de ngau gailak.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />A teilung tingdung au cang gwang dida; a mariemdung au hedeu kecai dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">nah cirünne mene a nlung hengindung de.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Mina aidungde, mide rangkemsiame aidungde, kemui de tei kedi pwa kebaa tei dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">kebaa au kemuibe taiga bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Ih magade ki hengin kebam ge bam liecai cide au Sheol;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">nah Ih magade a bam kemuibe gage teukam gai liecai;<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />nah Ih magade hangdeu koiki de rang eh, ‘Nang au a pei,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">nah tangseu be de pwa, ‘Nang au a pui mede a tipui,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />iciucai daiga a keregui de bamno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">A keregui ziemne au, cauge daige ngaulu lai?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />A hengim be acu ngngwa eh ketsaime mbau kela heriekidung ga hung zieni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">anui rebui ga kenghung dau?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Pecai Bildad Shuahmepei pe sam keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Daidau ne n sam rang mtakdi lau no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Macet gailo, nah pecaine anui resiu dai kera.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />N miak dwa gade daitei anuide heram kaune nah kemta lie lano?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Nang au n rata le ncu teurak bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">n ziemne kideube de gidi zieni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">meliede tangtsudung de pe bam gade keugi dizie ni?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Kesang lie, mina kenlienme kebaa au tei mmüt dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">penui miheu de baa si lakta.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Pegu paiki ga kebaa de mui dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">pe mitaubung pe reu ga kebamde tei mmüt dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Pe pihwa kengkieng de tei mdui dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">pekatei pe mariem dene pecu tei ngkau dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Pekatei pe pi ne pecu kelien pwa helang be gage kai luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">pa tet pwa hangdeu koiki gage kaugai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Hetak gage pe pitang keu lu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">hetak ge ne pecu keu pwabam dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Pe ziemne ngwangdwak ge hangdeu gage hebaih pwabam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">nah pe lampui gage hetak ge tei pwabam.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Mi ngau kehing kekeheu le pecu twagwapung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">pe pikietdung ga penui pecu gwala.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Pe maheidung ne pecu peu mzeu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">nah ma kengkapbe pe taiga mteipwabam dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Pe pumteih kesa au ngkap cangsiak dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">cinzwa delwe, ketsai nalung raitube pe pumteihbe kesa ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Pecu pe paiki kekwak bam gade teurak dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">nah mi ngau kehing gwangpei dage tet gai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Sulfur kilung gage ruizang pwa kebam penui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">ngau kelucai pe mina kemakmedung ne pe paiki ga lung dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Pe mah au pekang gade ki dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">pereu le pekiakdung dang gi dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Kideu gade pecu nsung ta dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">puidi be ga pe zi gah dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Pecu kebaa gade kemuibe gage gwagai dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">nah kideu gwa le ge gwagai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Pa pe na mede pe ca pe minadung kakga bam lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">meliene pa kebam ga pecu kemname de bam lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:14">Job 27:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Naimiak lütle lungh kebamme de tingnaige pe dage tei kegai miswakegah de ne keheu süt gai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">nah naimiak kepetle kebamme de de cidene keheu dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:13">Lei. 37:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Mina masang kemakme ki au cide kesang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">Tinggwang de cikemakme bamdung au.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Cidau Job keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Daitie ge nnui acu tei keherei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">nah samdung le acu tei kecaidi laino?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Nnui pia kerei acu kesiu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">nnui ada ge ma siasüt kecu tei gai de nnui ngngam bam meda.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Magade Ih ne tei maudi kesang liecai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">a mau bam kecu de akatei a zieda.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Magade nnuikatei nnuide tei cehu pwa a nreu hang cai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">nah hengam ziemne acu mmau cai,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />ciucai nnui Tinggwang ne a dage tei mau kegai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">nah acu baih gage tui kegai cibam kerabe.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Pielo, Ih hap pet gai, “Ngngwakesia!” dede Ih samli ge de ngaulu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Ih kengha qu gai, dede cika petaube gadi.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Pa ne a lampui kamdi ciu eh peu acu tetkah kelakne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">nah pa kemui le a lampui kam di.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Pa a dade hetwa herüt gau mpetdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">nah hegwang peurwa a peu gade keumpet di.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Pa acu teipang teipop di, nah Ih au mta di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">pa acu teuncuh pwa a keregui tsingbang ge nzwa beuda.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Pa pe rata a dage rui gai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">pa au acu pe ngauraume lie la dida.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Pe reugwame gwang ngkwa lwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">penui hang acu mcwa kera tei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">nah a paiki twagwa lu.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Pa a siname de ada de keumdei dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">a zangname ada de mdei di.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />A kibaume acu püt dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">acu kenna zangmedung acu nsungta dida.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Nda a kiga hegia tei kebamme nah a kila puidung acu le sangcikemakme nzwa dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">Ih penui dwa gade mina ketsamme ge nzwa dida.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Ih a kilame ge de qugai, dede pa a sam keli beuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">Ih a mui le pecu tumgai liede.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />A kwa a ledlei a nau pe sui lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">a pui za gade mna kelume dade liede Ih au kengkau ge dida.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Hena keceunadung de acu ngau nghetdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">Ih cuh lwe marang liede, penui a samrang mmau di.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Acu kehung zangmedung acu ngau nghetdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">Ih kehungme acu mmau eh a dade nreu tetdi.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />A radung a geu nah a ci ga koplwe bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">Ih a gei geu ziemne ringbam.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Acu ngaungia lo, acu ngaungia lo, a zangmedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">kedanemene Tinggwang ba ne acu tung gai da.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Daitei eh nnui Tinggwang nzwa acu tei keherei lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Nnui a pumteih de le mnunglu buini?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Oh, cu a samdung raulu liecai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">Oh, cidungde laisiukwak ge gage raulu liecai!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Oh, cide raukelu hegeu kerautie le raulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">penui tsuradung gage kelungta ziemne raulu liecai.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Dede a ziemne au, acu relikelube ring kebam Ih ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">nah kekam le pa kideu ga sap zie;<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />a geu, cide au mipum, teimsia kedi cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">a pumteih gade Ih Tinggwang de ngau zie.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Ih akatei a miakle pecu ngau zie, Ih, nah mi kedame ge de lak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">A nlung ada de peta tei ta dida.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Magade nnui rang eh, ‘Dainzwa anui pecu tei keherei lulai no!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">Keherei kecu pe da bam,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />nnui kiengtie de hing lulo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang tutiak: Tinggwang rata </char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">kedanemene rata au kiengtie saja beula kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">iciu de nnui hetuketiak ge kebam cilu kerane.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Zophar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Pecai Zophar Naamahmepei keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“A lungcet ne acu tei pwa keli guide gai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">kedanemene a lungrei ada kebam ziemne.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Acu rütkemak kwa ge acu kesiu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">dede Ih cilu kela rabe acu keli beu.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Nang cimeni makesang aide ndaa gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">Tinggwang mina de kideu gage kai kelu dau:<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />mina kenlienme ngkieng kebam au peting keduina ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">nah hezai tei eh pesuiyi kelame suiyi au bam tie lu lama?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Pe hu hang tinggimdung tungbam liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">nah pe peu hemwa tungbam liede,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />ciuliede pa pekatei rebui nzwa gah dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">caugame pecu ngau bi rang zie, ‘Pa daiga bam no?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Pa au hemang ge nzwa liem tetdi da nah ngau dailak ta;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">kesang, tingmui makengau nzwa pecu gwa mpak dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Pe miak pa ngau kecudung ngau si tadi zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">pa kebam kelak de ngau si tadi zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Pe name kegahme dade pemau kie zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">pe badung pe maheidung keu caili beu zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Peradung au perehang dau kengkieng kepui teibam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">dede cide rebui teidi zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Makesiabe au pe mui gade kum,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">pa cide pe mleu kangga de kebai teu bamla,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />pa cika kai pwabam nah peu tetdi mene bam liede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">dede cu liede pe mui gage kai pwabam reu,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />pe taktyei peraidung ga kah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">cide henei mcai nzwa heiring dila.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Pa maheidung de mneu lula, dede pa nrui mpet dai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Tinggwang cidungde pe za gade keu mpet dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Pa henei mcai heiring ntim luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">henei mleu de ne pecu teitset dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Pa reuceunadung heliadui nah maca</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">kelwa gade pesuiyi ngau gailak.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Pa rei kegai tsi bui kelu de peu caili dai dizie nah pa tyei gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">pa pe lila gade hi kelu mahei de teu pe suiyi ngau gailak.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Kedanemene pa kegahme de mneu nah teikeherei la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">pa tei kemak kidung de pezai siasüt eh keu tetdi.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Kedanemene pa pekatei kemnung ketde cilu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">pa pe suiyi eh keu keludung ketde hekwa gailak.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Pa ne ngkap kemak ketde bam ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">cine pe mahei de au bammui lu gailak.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Pe mahei pui nlim kebam ga pa keherei eh kau mie dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">ma kegahme pelane ba gwang pecu renia dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Pa mapwa peza tei puilu zie lie kebam dau, Tinggwang pe lunghop nah rata pecu peu gai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">pa matyei kebam dau Tinggwang tingrui lang nghung gai zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Pa hegeu kiengtie gade pak zielie kebam dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">hetageu lakpi ge ne pecu kap dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Pe caile de cide teu mpet</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">pe mceu gade mzai liklik kecu mui ge pet.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">Pereu ga kehing gwangdi.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Pe mabam de ziemne muiting kecu kai pwabam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">ntaugai kemak mi ne pecu ru dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">cide ne pe paiki kiga dai bangbam bi ru dizie.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Tinggimdung pe mau keulia gai beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">nah kideube cuh eh pecu kemmau zierang tei zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Pe ki mahei de gah dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">Tinggwang pe rata kelu benai pe gudung de ngngwa eh gadi zie.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Aide Tinggwang dade kenlienme kwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">Tinggwang ne pe ziemne mapwa ge mtei pwabam.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:13">Job 27:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Pecai Job pesam keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“A samdung kingnei sünne gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">nah aide le nnui acu kepeu ziune kecu ge lulo.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Ada ge ranggai lo, nah Ih de marang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">Ih rang kelu cai, reli pielo.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Ih de kecu, a ncam mige dage ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Daitei Ih alungdui melai?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Acu piegai eh nnui swa galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">nah nnui mui gage nnui ba le keba lu.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Ih a reidung de mning gaige, acu keheu di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">nah kembeu ne a pum mlai gailak di.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Daitei eh peu kemaume de lungh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">hecing cu, nah kengkieng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lunghyi </char></note> teula no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:6">Job 12:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Penui miakngau gade penui leuhme penuide ngngwa lungh yi kebam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">nah penui miakngau gade penui tsaname lungh yi kebam.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Penui kidung au kehing gade kwak bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">mede Tinggwang rata tuitie penui deu ga bam lama.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Penui tumseu leuhdung lungh lula; cide gahdi lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">penui tumdung ngkak beula nah taidi lama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:26">Tet. 23:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Meurünna hau nzwa lang mpet beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">nah penui name helimlim la.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Penui tambourine nah leibung kwa eh lei tei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">nah terwaine kwa eh penui suiyi bamla.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Penui lunghyi eh penui tingbadung ngngwang la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">nah penui zingde ketsaime deu ga hung dila.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Penui Tinggwang dage rang, ‘Anui de pütdi lulo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">kedanemene anui maci lampuidung anui sui lama.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Dai de Ngkiengtube Tinggwang no, anui pecu reca kera?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Anui pe dade kie cai dai kemmi ge ngaulu bui no?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Pielo, penui lungyi kebam de penui ba ga bamni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">Ih mina kesiame ne rang kebeu de teu magede ketei ga.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Pia daikie ge de mina kesiame mitau teimmüt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">mede penui da kengkap penui reu ga gwang lai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Pia daikie ge de Tinggwang pe rata penui reu gage lungrei mzigai zieno?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Pia daikie ge penui tingkai ga herarie ge nzwa zie no</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">mede tingkai rahang ne reigau gui pwa tetdi kela nzwa lai?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Nang rang la, ‘Tinggwang pemau ziemne pena reu ga gwangla.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Pekatei rui lulo, ciude pa pekatei pecu pemau ci lu bui lu.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Peu pe miak gade pekatei pecu kekap ngau zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">nah pecu Ngkiengtube Tinggwang lunghop sak zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:8">Lei. 75:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Pe teilung cang kedi dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">pa pe kilungme ziemne helung pang lani?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Mige Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">heni kecehudung ga kebamme tutiak kelabe de maci ledeu lubuini?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Mige au keyi kengkieng lung relui cui nah sünne kebam ting dau tsai dila.<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Pe pum au maca ne puipung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">nah pera au peking dui ne teihwa eh bam lie.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Kedame au suiyi gede ga zing,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">penui penui lungh keherei süt eh lungh nah tsai dila.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Penui pelane nzwa ciak eh tsai nah kung dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">penui pelane de tangseudung ne tyei dila.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Ainie, nnui lungningdung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">nah nnui aha petau kemakpe riem kecu cibam.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Kedanemene nnui keteu, ‘Cu daiga hegwangpeina ki bam no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Mina kesiabe lungh kela paiki de daiga bam no?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Nnui mbeuh kelame de keteu melui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Penui sam teu caili kegwang de nnui ci meni,<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />kengkap tingba benai kemaume de kaipwa bam lie kecu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">nah lunghop tingba benai pecu mbai beulie kecu?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:29">Job 20:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Caune kemaube de muicui eh pecu mmau gailai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Caune pane tei kegaidung leune rüi beulai?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Iciu lie de pecu herau gage pwa miedi zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">nah minadung herau ga kwabam dizie.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Kideu lamkie ga hangdeudung de pe dade kum,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">nah mina kekieege<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mina kekieege: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pecai herau ga sui mie dizie.</char></note> pecai sui dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">pedwa ga mina peikap gai kelak kebam nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Daitei eh pekiekegah samle nnui a lung teinciep lano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">kedanemene nnui samlidung ga au magede gah kenretbe gwale?”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Eliphaz</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Ge Eliphaz Temanmepei keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Mige Tinggwang dwa de pemi kebam ge tei lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Makecime ge pe ziemne heta teilu bui ni?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Nang petau be tei cu ziemne Ngkiengtube pesui yi lani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Ma gade kemmi ge ni peziemne ncu mmau kera lampui gah cai?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Nang pecu rüt kelane ncu kesiu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">nah tutiak gage nggwa gai di ni?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />N kesia di ham meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Nang kemau ketei penli ga ni?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />N sinabe dade n sampet tei kelu pekie kega ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">nang pe paini keuteudi nah pecu bah kera gede bang beu ma.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Nang leu kelame de dui sak kera pwapeu ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">Nang nzeu kela mede penui puk tei raudi.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Nang, kengkiengme pei ge lie de, kideu gumlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">nang, hetwa kepung me pei ge, cika lungh bamla.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Nang hemipui de mta langgi di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">nggianadung de süt tyei nah kenneu ta tei.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ciziemne, ncu hekwadungne twagwa ciak bam dida</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">nah zette kengngi ne ncu tei keherei bam.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Kemui kebamne nang ma ngau gailak di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">nah ncu duipui nliem kebam de ne sung bam.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Tinggwang tinggim hutu ga bam meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Hegi kehu de pie lo, dai hia ge de cehu bi!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Dede nang rang eh, ‘Tinggwang daipai ci no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Pa muiting kecu gade tutiak teilu bui ni?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Hemwa kedi ge ne pecu sung pwa bam, anuide peu ngau melu kerane;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">Pa tinggim ga tet twagwa la.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Nang nda tei kela de tei bam zie ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">kemaume tet kela ga.<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Penuide au peting gwang kemak dwa de jüt teudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">penui pibang au duidiet gene zwa pung teutet dida.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Cipaume Tinggwang de mlai eh, ‘Anui dade mdei lulo’; nah penui rang ‘Ngkiengtube Tinggwang anuide dai teilu bui no?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Iciude pa penui ki ga ma keyi leu kai pui beula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">kemaume lungning gade pa mdei dila.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Mina keyime penuide ngau lwe pesui yi bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">nah mina kemzuime nuibamla penui de saja kepeu ngau kelu dau.<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />Penui rang, ‘Kesangbe de caune anuide renia labi penui kapdi zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">mi ne penui mahei leune rudi la.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Cu Tinggwang de kesamtei lwe ngngwa yilulo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">ciciu lu cai, n da keyibe gwang zie.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Lulu, I kiela, pemui gade ledeu kebeu sam de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">hekwa lu pe sam mlung gage.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Nang Ngkiengtube Tinggwang da caili gwang dai cai, ncu pwa peu dai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">magede nang kemau ketei n ki gade kai mdeidi lucai.<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />Ngu mabam kelien gidi lo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">Ophir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ophir aide kecak keyi deu ge.</char></note> gu kecak de hereuki tangtsu kak gage kelien gi di lu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ophir aide kecak keyibe de rang bam. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />nah Ngkiengtube Tinggwang de pwa n mabam teilu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">pemi kehung rangkang geu ncu peu zie.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Iciulu de nang suiyi ngau lu zie Ngkiengtube Tinggwang dade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">nang nzu pwa Tinggwang de ngang pie luzie.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Nang ngu kekie peda ge kiegai zie, nah n kekie keli beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">nang nsampet tei kelu mneilu zie.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Nang rang kepet leune ga nziemne teicang beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">n lampui ga kebaa tau beu zie.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Tinggwang ngang kelame de teu henah dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">nah henah kelame de kelibeu la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 23:12, 1 Pet. 5:6, Mac. 29:23</char></note><verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Pa nzuicang kemakme de de keli beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">cipaume de n kemci badung ziemne keli beu zie.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ge Job keligai,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Henai kecang de Ih ncamsüt bam reu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">Tinggwang ba au a rei mra swade rüt bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Oh, Ih pecu dai gade ngau lubui bi Ih cibam!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">Oh, ciciu eh Ih Tinggwang kebam ni ga gwanglu kerane!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ih a ha pe dwa gage pwalia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">delwe pecu rang renia kieesüt zie.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Pa a sam keli kegai gade Ih samkiedung ci luzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">nah pa a da rang kegaidung ci luzie.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Pe kengking kedi gade pa acu rang renia zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Melie, pa a sam kingnei zie lie.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Makesangme ge au pecu rang renia zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Ainzwa eh a tuketiakbe acu lungmpet ncigi beu zie.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Pielo, Ih kepetle bie mie, dede pa cika bam ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">nah kelütle bie mie, dede Ih pecu ngau luma.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Tingtünle, pa mata tei kebam ga hang, dede Ih pecu ngau luma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">nah tingbangle hung, acu peu pecu ngau kelakne pa mbai di.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Dede Ih tet kela lampui de pa cibam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">pa acu kedak pie kecudau, Ih au kecak nzwa mpet luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pet. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />A pipa de pe pipa ga pwa ntipsütla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">Ih pe lampui de pwala nah cikade nreu dima.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Pane aja kai kedi gade Ih nreu caili dima;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">Ih a taktyei be swade pemui gade kerang samdung be kebai hemi ki pwa bam.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Dede pa kenzwa ge de gah, caune pecu teu caili lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">Pa tei keneu be, pa teila.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Kedanemene pa acu mmau eh pegu aja de teigai da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">ci kenzwa kekiee ge bam.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Cine, pa kebam ga Ih au ngngi di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">Ih pecu nning kegai dau, Ih pecu hing di.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Kedanemene Tinggwang au a mlung tei nnei kedine;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Ngkiengtube Tinggwang ne acu tei ngngi kedine.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Kemuine acu peu penli tei dima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">kedanemene a suisia zu di eh kemui kedi de ne gum pungbam reulu.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Daitei Ngkiengtube Tinggwang kenlienme tutiak kera peting riet meno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Daitei Tinggwang dade masang kelame tutiak kera petingba kegwang ngau meno?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Kenlienme herai de deu nlai kecudung ge bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">kenlienmedung ge meurün hau kemei tei eh gwa teu kedidung ge bam delwe penui gu cehei ziu gage kai lu.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Penui peime kegame gu gada de penui gwa tet dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">penui hemipui tumseu de penui pau kapcang kemak ta kai nzeu di la.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Penui makegame de penui lampui gade gwagi dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">penui dade kideu ga makegame pelane mbai di la<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Pielo, hetaideu ga gadadung nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">makegah aidungde penui taktyei pei eh penui tah tei kerane tetpet la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">Arabah ne penui name de penui taktyei pwa peu kera nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Makegame tingmui ne mikedame luhdung gade luhlüt la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">penui kenlienme kube luh gade hekwa lula.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Penui tingmui zie pelane pai ba mene paula zeu bam la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">tingkengkung dau penui pai ba kera ga.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Lamlwadung gade hezim kei mie penuide dia hwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">penui tangtsu kedidung taiga zeula kedanemene penui nsiu kegane.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Kenlienme pe pei kegahmedung de pe pui tungtung kecu gade sütteu dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">nah kenlienme kegahme dade penui namedung de hepau lam de ngngwa teu dila.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Kegahme penui paini teu mene paula bam la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">penui mzeu liede, mi kedame meikwa pung bamla.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Kegahme kenlienme ki gade maca tei la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">penui kenlienme zauniakbam gade tui lula, dede penui be hereu eh rei bam la.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Namdi be gade tsaidi lai kebamme mra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">nah rejam kedimedung kengha kie eh mra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">Dede Tinggwang kingnei beu ma<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Kenlienme midung ge kebaa de renia di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">penui lampui ci ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">mede penui lampui cide ga la ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Tingba kemakne mide dap ketset be cuhlu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">nah pa makegame de dap tset;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">tingmui tingdau pa au keregame ge nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Cipau reu ge, kemmhame miak au mui kenlüt de kwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">pa rang eh, ‘Mige de acu ngau lak.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">Pa pezu tei ntsam di.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Tingkemui dau kenlienme kidung ga lütla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">dede penui tingna au mbai bam la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">penui keba de masi pei lama.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Penui pelane ziemne au, muiting kecu de au tingcang nzwa da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">kedanemene muiting kecu de au penui zangna de lu.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />Ciciu de, penui zette, dui nswak ge nzwa gah dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">penui deu de au reset dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">mige de penui kube luh ga mie mata tei lama.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Tingkecangh nah kelum dene buising dui mmi di kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">cinzwa ketsaime deu ne kemaume de teutet dila.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Pecu tetlak kepungbe de pecu nsungta dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">tangseu ne pecu tyei kehega eh tyei luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">pecu nsung ta di zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">ainzwa eh, kenlien au tsingbang ge nzwa pangpop dizie.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Kenlienbe hena mna kemak nagahpuidung de tuityei lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">pa hemipui da ge makeyi tei lak.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Ciciu de pe kengkieng de ne mina kengkiengme de teu tet dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">pa cuh delwe penuide penui teilung tei ngkieng beu lak.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Penui kwak bam lie kecu kenning Tinggwang ne tei beu, nah penui cide penui suiyi lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">dede penui lampui de pie bam la.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Mina aidung de de tei cehu beu; iciu eh, peting kedui nage gage penui bamsi tadi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">kesang, penuide luu teu di zie; penuide meitsi nzwa rum dizie.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Aide nzwa melie cai, caune acu kenret me lie kecu lia lu lai no;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">cau ge a samrang de mage de kemak tei lai no?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Bildad</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Pecai Shuahme pei Bildad keligai;<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Kengkieng nah kehing peda la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">pa tinggim heni kecehudung gade ngngwa keyi kaizeulu.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Pe reugwame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">samgwame</char></note> de peikap lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Pe kebaa cauda baa kemak bam no?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Ciucai Tinggwang dwa gade cauge masanglu lai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Dainzwa mipui ge dade lungh gwang kelu ge mci eh pa luu lu kebui teilu buino?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Pielo, hekei kecang de pe da de pe baa ga;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">hegidungde pe miak ngau gade mci ma.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Mina au ciswa sia lie, pa au tangseu ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">Mina nabe ge au, tangseu ge lie!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ge job keli eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Dainzwa nang pe kengkieng kegah gede ngha lulai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">Dainzwa nang pe ba kengkieng kegah gede kelilu lai!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Dainzwa nang maci kegah kau gede marang lia lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">nah maci keyi recilia lulai!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Nang caube ngha teu eh sam aidung de rang lai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">N da ge caube rabe mpet no?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Ketsaime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">dui kangga kebamme</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">nah cika lung kebam pelane de tei mbeu dila.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Tinggwang dwagade Sheol au paula bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">kengkap pe da pedwa gade mbai gai lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 139:8-11, Mac. 15:11, Heb. 4:13</char></note><verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Ting nreule de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">nta kebam ni gage teu lim gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">nah pa kideu be de mage de kegah gage gwak gai.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Pa hemwa kesiu gage duidung de dumlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">dede perüt de ziemne hemwadung pangdi ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Pa hekei zu de gumlu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">nah pa hemwa de zang gai.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Pa dui gu rai de riet twa gwa lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">kemui penai kebaa kak de nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Tinggim tsiadung mbeu di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">nah pa herata kegai dau penui macang di.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Pa pe kengkieng teu eh jaaidi de tei zing dedi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">pe maci de le Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:12 </char></note> de teipop di.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Pecui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rabe gade </char></note> ge le pa tingkamdung tei mci di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">pe ba ge le neidi pak kela gede reudi.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Pielo, dede aidungde au pezai keceunadung ge lie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">daicam nage anui peha siu bam no!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Cau ne pe kengkieng kedi de ci canglu lai no?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Job marang dai eh cu,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Tinggwang ring la kesang kecu nzwa, pa ne a nzeu de keu teu dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Ngkiengtube, pane a teilung tei kaa dida,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />a kering a da kebam dau de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">nah Tinggwang cuinggi de a nkie ga bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">Ih aide tei zie.<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />A muileu kesiabe sam rang lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">mede a nleu kecwa sam rang lak;<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Ih madaude nnui hangcumcum de petau delie beulak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">Ih tsaidi kemak tane Ih petau bam lie kecu mlai dilak.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Ih a kenzeube herak mtip luzie nah Ih peu tetdi lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">Ih ring kebam tane a lungning de peu acu mmau lak.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />A ngauraube de peu kenlien be nzwa di lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">acu culwe kereniabe de peu petau kemak mege nzwa di lu.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Kedanemene Tinggwang de si kemakme ge pe keregui de dai no Tinggwang pecu cakgi kedi dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">Tinggwang pe teilungh keu teu kedi dau?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Keherei pe da kegwang dau pa sa kegai de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">Tinggwang kingnei zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Ngkiengtube Tinggwang dade pa pekatei pecu pesui lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">nah peting pelane gade Tinggwang de qu lu zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Tinggwang tahtei Ih ncu ledeu beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">Ngkiengtube lungning Ih kebai di lak.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Pielo, aide nnui pelane ngau da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">ciciu cai daitei nnui kemta aide rang la no?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Tinggwang dade kenlienme ge kwa aide da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">mide teikeherei kelame de Ngkiengtube dade ngaukelu mapwa deda:<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />magade pename hing pet lu cai, cide au kiengtie ziemne;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">peleu pehiak madau gede kennung ketyeipok ngau gailak.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Cikade kwak kelume rapia gade tsai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">nah penui naume penui de hei eh hap lak.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Kenlienme ge rangkang rebui kie ge hekwa pwa bam de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">nah pai heni lidei kieege keswa pwa bam de,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />pa pai heni hekwa süt pwa bam de, kenzeume ne cide bah dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">nah petau tei eh kelame ne rangkang penui kakgage mzi luzie.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Tamriakpe ge nzwa pa peki teilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">kekwame ge ki keceu nage teikelu nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Pa keheime ge tei eh zeu ga zeu, dede pa ciciu mui eh bam lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">pa pemiak nrak gaige, ma pelane gahdi.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Kerehim gele dui nzwa pecu kezuilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">rahang gene tingmui pecu teu tetdi.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Naimiak kepetle tingkai ne pecu guiteu tetdi, nah pa tetdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">pa lungh kebam ni gade pecu biak pungdi.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Cide pecu sam nah ntak ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">pa cikade pak kera tei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang kengking</char></note><verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Cide peba ge le pecu tui pwadi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">nah pe sap bam gade pecu gui pung di.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Cika rangkanggeu kekuiki bam kesang lie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">penui kecak tei mcilu kela ni ge.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Kideu gade hegeu keu mpetlu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">tangtsu gade hetageu tei sui mpetlu la.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Mina kemui kezing penli ga mie delwe peeila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">nah deitu ga kecang de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">tangtsudung peei miela mi mielakemak muiting gade.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Mina lungla kemak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">mina pihi gaila kemak deu tei pop gwangla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">Pa mina bam kemak kendei ga rwa mpet nlüt teila.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Kideu gade, ketyei pok pet kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">cide mi ge nzwa pekang gade mpetla.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Tangtsu cidungde ga sapphire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tangtsu pemi kehung kepu be</char></note> ngau lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">nah cipau suinadung ga kecak bamla.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Tuityei kela ruine lampui cide cima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">mede cide heraruine ngau ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Makaunedung de lampui ci kenzwa ga tetkah ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">mede hingho kekuu be de.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Mina tangtsu ketakbe de tei pop;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">pa lamlwadung mah ri mpet.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Pa tangtsudung ga pe koikidung rila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">pa cika pemi kehung leu ngau.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Pa reuceunadung de kang di ciciu eh penui lwa gai kelak tei di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">cika kebai pwa kebamdung de kebaa gage pwa mpetlu.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Dai gade maci peei lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Daiga maci bam no?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Mina au cipau mi de cima;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">mede keringme kebam niga cide ngau luma.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Kideu kangga kebam dui kecok be rang, ‘Cide a da bam ma’;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">jaaidi be rang kecu, ‘Cide a da bam ma.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Cide au kecak ge le rehiak gai lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">mede cide rangkanggeu ge le pemi mdet gailak.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Cide Ophir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide au hangdeu</char></note> gu kecak ge le de keda gai lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">onyx<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tangtsu pemi kehung</char></note> mede sapphire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tangtsu pemi kehung ge</char></note> le de.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Kecak nah crystal swade pe mi kiee;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">cide kecak le ketei heteidung le de rehiak gai lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:10">Mac. 8:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Coral<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tangtsu pemi kehung</char></note> mede jasper swade pemi hung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">kesang lie, maci au hegakang swade pemi hung lie.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Cide au Cush gu topaz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pemi kehung kenzim tangtsu</char></note> le de keda gai lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">mede kecak mcitube le teu pe mi mdet canggai lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:19">Mac. 8:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Dai gade, ciciu cai, maci gwang no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Makeci kecet bam daiga bam no?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Maci au ring kelame dade kebai dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">nah tinggim ruinedung dade hebai dila.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Kengkap nah Ketsai rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Anui kwen le ledkiee sam cide reki kebam siu da.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:11">Keu. 9:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Tinggwang au lampui cide cibam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">pa pe bam cide cibam.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Kedanemene pa kideu penli ga kecang de pie bam kelane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">nah tinggim kang kebam pelane ngau kebamne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 11:4">Lei. 11:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Pa tingkai kecii teigai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">nah duidung de perüt mdetlu.<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />Pa tingrui kera ting rietlu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">nah tingceu kera lampui ge tei gai.<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />Ciciu eh pa maci ngau lwe cide reci lia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">pa cide teilu, kesang, nah pa cide piegai.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Tinggwang minadung dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Pielo, Rampaube de kerüt au, cide maci delie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">kenlien be dade cam mpet kelu au maci delie.’” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:6">Hez. 4:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Job marang dai eh cu,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Oh, Tinggwang nda a mapie kela dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">nzwa lie cai au,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />pe mitaubung a reu ga baa keladau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">nah Ih pe kebaa gade kemui tet kahgwang lu.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Oh, cide a tingbaziedung yitube ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">Tinggwang de ngngwa zangna ketei a paiki ga bam kelu dau,<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Ngkiengtube Tinggwang acu ngngwa kebam dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">nah a namedung acu twagwapung kebamdau,<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />a lampui maca gele kemai pwa kebamdau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">nah tsura gade maca reudung lwa kepetdau!<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Namdi be herieki gade Ih tet kepet dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">Ih namdi be kuda ga Ih a bam ga bam kelu dau,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />henamedung acu ngaulwe penui a dade ndei di hetwa herüt peu eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">nah kecingme a ziemne cuh saplu.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Hegwang namedung Ih gwang kecu tingdau marang tadi la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">penui penui ba pwa penui mui gum dila.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Mina kedimedung de matu tadi la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">nah penui mui gade penui mleu kekam dila.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Penui a kwa siu keludau, penui acu samlam beula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">penui acu ngau keludau, penui acu samlam beula nah acu petau delie la<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />kedanemene makegahbe pe ngngia kie kegai dau Ih pecu kelilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">nah pe pei kegahbe mige nede ngha beu kera gah eh mra kegaidau keli beu.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Kapdi lai eh kebamme ge samlam a da gwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">Ih hemipui ge lung teipwa suiyi lei tei.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Ih kenzeu be keulu, nah cide le acu kezuilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">a samsang au pai ge nzwa nah peurwa ge nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Ih au miakcietme miak lie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">Ih au pe pi kesiame pi ge.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Ih au ma kegahme pei ge tei eh gwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">Ih au cikemakme ha de pie sünne beula.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Ih masang kemakme geija teipang dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">pe geidung kakgade kesiabe de zütdi la.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Pecai Ih ranggai, ‘Ih a ciep gade tsai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">Ih a tingbaziedung heciang swa kekiee teibeu zie.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />A mahdung himpwa duidung ga zangra pet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">nah a kiakdung ga tingmui zie pelane hezim zau.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Hetwa herüt a da kebam de heci bam muila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">nah a kengkieng lakpi de a ba gade heci bam muila.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Mina a kwa kingneila; penui acu kwa bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">penui zing de eh Ih rang kegai de kingnei bamla.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />A samrangdung de tei di ge, penui marang dai lamah;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">a samrang penui reu ga dui nzwa cak miela.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Penui keheidau liede acu kwa bamla penui tingrui de kekwa nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">penui mui ngngarang lwe a samdung de sak kera teila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">tingrui kekambe da teigai kera nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Ih penui dage nuirum gaila penui cide mning bam kemakdau;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">penui a zu gade kebaa kepet de nlai di lama.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Ih penui lampui kedet lula nah penui muiteu be nzwa ntum bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">pe reugwame kakga Ih hegwangme ge nzwa lung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">hei eh kehapme lung tau kelame ge nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Dede cu au Ih a swa kehename dwa de magede tadi da acu teu henui tei dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">hena aipaudung peime de au Ih a meurün hau taiga heteudung de de ngngwa eh peu heta teimah.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Kesang, penui peime kengkieng dainzwa acu ngha lulai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">penui heri beting cang kedi cai?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Penui au makegah nah kenzeu gade ntiang dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">penui mina lunghlakemak nah renaamkang kemui gade mari tyei.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Penui mabang pai nah tsinghum gade peneidung nggi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">tampiak mahdung rilwe penui tyei.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Penuide minadung kakgade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">keregame ge de kesiu kecu nzwa gwa mpetdi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Cine penui hereuki langkamdung ga lungla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">tsupop nah kideu koikidung ga lungla.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Ceheihum kakgade penui gada nzwa mra bamla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">nah hetubang kangga ngkwa bamla.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Penui au kemie namedung lie, kesang, masipei kemakmedung!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">Penuide au kedap ria le gwagi kedimedung.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Dede cu au Ih penuine nui keneume ge dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">Ih cu penuine a ha kerangme ge tei dida.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Penui acu nneu nah a dade ndei dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">penui mcai nsui pwa a zu gage kekai de penuide kezeulu meda.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Kedanemene Tinggwang a lakpi ria hiakdi delwe acu saa bam kedine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">nah penui a rata tei kerane adwa gade penuide kezeu luma.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />A zetle bie rehangme cuhlu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">penui acu gwagi nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">penuine tui kelu gu niadung de le pwa a lampui kam.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Penui a lampui tei msia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">penui kengkap de cwakpwa a lam ge kai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">penuide migede kamlu kera gada.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Penui namdi be kirie ngkei nza pwa kebam gade reugwame kegwang nzwa acu renia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">ngkap kebamdau penui nla mie acu sam.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Kerehimbe a da gwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">acu kerüt de tingkai ne guipung kedi nzwa gahdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">a mabam hemwa nzwa tetdi.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />A keringria a lung gade lwa mpet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">a rei tingbadung acu tui teu di.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Tingmui a radung tei pop lüt;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">a keteei de ne geigim eh ntak ma.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Tinggwang kengkieng de ne a pai teu teudi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">cide ne acu kezuibing di.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Acu nyasai gage kelien gaidi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">Ih miceu nah rebui nzwa dida.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Ih n dage mra gai, Tinggwang, dede nang a sam keli ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">Ih cuh saplu, nah nang acu piegai kecu rünne.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Nang tsam di nah a dade n zai sia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">n ba kengkieng delwe acu tei keherei.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Acu tingkai gage teuncuh lu delwe cide ne acu guipung di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">nang rahang gade acu kecui nlüt mpet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">keda laisiukwak ga </char><char style="fqa">nang rahang gade acu teisui dida kecu bam. </char> </note><verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Nang acu ketsai gage teu gaidi kera Ih cibam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">keringme pelane de kai zielie kedet pwa kebam ki gage.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Ciciude, kau kemiedau migede pe ba hetwa pwa kengha kie meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">Keherei keludau migede kengha kie meni?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Pa keherei keludau Ih pe ziemne hap meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">Kegahme ge ziemne Ih a lung keherei meni?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Ih keyibe kereguidau, cidau kesiabe gwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">Ih kebaa be de kwa kebamdau, cide mene kemuibe gwang.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />A mlungbe rei nah mtak meda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">keherei tingbadung a da gwang bam.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Kemui ga lungh kelame ge nzwa Ih la dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">dede cide au naimiak ziemne mah;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">Ih hemaa be gade sap eh kengha kie gai.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ih maiserung siname ge dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">ostrich ruine kangzangme ge dida.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />A geu au tiak nah a dade nlwak mpetdi zeu da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">a radung au kelumne ru.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Ciziemne a leibung au hei eh kehap leidung tei kerane mtei pwabam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">a gu terwaine lei au nrung kebamme leitei ge dida.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Ih a miak de ngngwa sampet ge tei luda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">iciu cai dainzwa Ih releime de hengin eh pie lai?<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Kedanemene Tinggwang nreule kebambe dade anui qwa daipai geno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Ngkiengtube Tinggwang dade anui mapwa de?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Ih kengkap au mina masangkemakme ziemne ha de cetla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">nah cipau kengkapde au kesiatadung tei kelame ziemne lie.<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Tinggwang a lampuidung ngau la meni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">nah a pikietdung pei la meni?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Magade Ih kemau lampui ga ngngwa tet lie cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">magade a pi kecwa gage paklwet gai dicai,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Peu acu riangteukwak kensam gage arüt teu lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">iciu de Tinggwang a masang de cilu zie.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Magade a pikiet de lampui gade nreu tetdi cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">magade a nlung de a miak cai suidi cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">magade magiak keheibe a ba kenana ga kau teu dilie cai,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />Iciu cai peu acu malinglu, nah mikedame de peu tyeilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">nah peu a meibangdung de paidilu.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Magade a nlung de mipui gene cwa dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">magade Ih mbai eh a kidabe kikam ga kwa bam liecai,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />Iciu cai peu anau de mikedame ziemne ciu tau beu lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">nah peu kedame peidungde pecu ngngwa zeulu.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Iciu lie cai cide au ngau kehing kemau ge;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">kesang, cide au tutiakmedung ne saja peu lu kerabe mau da.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Iciu eh cide au mi cide kengkap pendei Abaddon ga kecang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">nah cide a lumeitsi pelane pe mah gage ru gai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Magade a kilapei mede kilapui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">acu ngngwa marangrenia eh kenzuibe tei beulo kekie dau Ih mlai dicai,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />Iciu cai Ih dai pai ge tei lai Tinggwang acu mmau kera cuh kecu dau?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Pa hetutiak kera kegwang dau, Ih dainzwa pe sam keli lai?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Acu a puipuk gage tei kegai dene penui dede teigai meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">Anuide tei kegai dene perehi gage pelane de anui puipuk gage tei gai meni?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Magade Ih kegahme gede penui hengin gade kai nzeu dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">mede magade Ih hemipui miakdung de tei msia di eh peu kehap gade mangau mci ta di cai,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Mede magade Ih ne akatei a taktyei de tyei pwa dicai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">nah pepei kegahme de peu tyei kera peu mecai,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />kedanemene a rehang relei tingdau gade nggiana acu ngngwa lungh cu mige pe pei de ngngwa kelungh nzwa eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">nah Ih ne pepui puisau tei, hemipui ge, a katei apui puk gade.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Magade Ih mikeheibede paiheni teu kera ga kedime gede ngau cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">mede magade Ih mige paiheni teu maikesia mege de ngau cai;<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />Magade pa pe nlung dele acu samlam beu mecai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">kedanemene a meurün mai le pecu tei nlum lu kemakne,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Ih a ba hwa pwa ngianedung de cwadi cai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">kedanemene Ih namdibe herieki tutiak gade ngkienglu kera ci eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">iciucai acu renia eh mmau kera teu gwang lu!<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />Ih ma aidungde teidi cai, iciucai a hekeutu de peu a tampiera gade nghai mie dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">nah peu a bapum de ketamtuk gade pang dilu.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Iciu eh Ih Tinggwang dade kegwang kengkap de kehing ne;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">kedanemene pe kedi dene, Ih cipaudung tadung de tei gai lak di.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Magade Ih kecak gede a keregui tei cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">nah magade Ih kecak dade rang eh, ‘Nang de da Ih kenlum de’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Magade Ih a suiyisüt dicai kedanemene a mahei kedi ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">kedanemene a ba ga mabamdung kiesüt kebam ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">iciu cai acu mmau kera teu gwang lu!<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Magade Ih tingnaimiak ba kepet dau ngau cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">mede hekei pe kebaadung de ga tet kela dau,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />Nah magade a mlung de de ngkim mbai eh mca dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">iciu eh a mui ne a ba de kemam eh cide de reca cai,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Aide de tutiakmedung ne saja peu kera mau ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">iciu eh nreu le kebam Tinggwang de Ih mlai di lu bui lu.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Magade Ih mikeheibe de acu ngau rau kelame kengkap de de a suiyisüt dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">mede kengkap peda gwang kelu dau a suiyi cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">iciu cai acu renia eh mmau kera teu gwang lu!<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Kesang, Ih a mui le kemau tei eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">pe teilung de reset kera de kie eh peu dema.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Magade minadung a ki ga kebamme madau de rang mecai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Cau ge mige de Job taktyei dele teipui lu kemak ngau lu bui no?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />(Sangme kecang de madaude namdibe renei ga bam kera bema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">kedanemene Ih hebeume ziemne kikamdung ngkei nzeupwa bam mui la),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">nah magade cide cinzwa mecai, iciu cai acu mmau kera teu gwanglu!<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Magade, mina kedame nzwa, Ih a maudung de kebai di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">a paiheni kang gage a maudung kebai teu la cai<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />(kedanemene Ih mina maadi kedi de de hing kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">kedanemene mi rütkemak kelakdung acu tei ngngisüt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">cide ziemne Ih zing de bam nah hegwale de pet ma),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">iciu cai acu mmau kera teu gwang lu!<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Oh, magade migede a sam kingnei kera bam lie cai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Pielo, aika a zi giak bam; peu Ngkiengtube Tinggwang de a sam keli lo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Magade a ngauraube acu kemmaude rauteu kela sam de a da bam lie cai!<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Kesang Ih a hekeutu gage ngauka eh keupung luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">Ih hegwangpeurwa nzwa kai lu zie.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ih pe dage Ih tei kedi leune ranggai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">kekuu kedime ge nzwa Ih peda hang zie.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Magade a deu acu mmau eh sah cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">nah cipau deudungde hap nsam gai cai,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />Magade Ih ne luhmeitsi de pemi tei beu mene lu tyei pwa dicai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">mede pe mpaumedung de tei keherei eh penui teilungdung ngkap dicai,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />Iciu cai wheat nding gade hetudung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">nah barley nding gade ceheidung peu lunglu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">Job samdung cang dida.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Iciu eh mina aipaudung hangcum de Job sam keli cu mtakdi kedanemene pa au pe katei pe miak dwa gade masang kecune. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Aipau cai Barakel napei Elihu Buzmepei, Ram kibaume ge pe rata kezeu gailak di; Job de pe rata sütdi kedanemene Job pe katei pecu Tinggwang swa mzui lie cet kedine. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Elihu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa au a Tinggwang </char></note> pe rata sütdi pe zangmedung hangcum de kedanemene penui Job sam keli kera ngau lu ta kedine, nah ainzwa lie de Job de mmau kebam ne. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu Job dage marang gai kera kwa bam kedanemene mina kedame be pe swa hecing kecune. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Iciuliede, mina aidung hangcum de penui muidung ga sam keli kera Elihu ngaulu ta kedi dau, pe rata kezeu gai lakdi.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Aipau cai Barakel napei Elihu Buzmepei marang cudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">“Ih hena au reu, nah nang au hecing süt dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">Ciziemne Ih rang zie lie kebam a kecet de kainzeu dai dida.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Ih ranggai, “Tingbaziedung ketiege au marang mai sia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">mmi kekieeme maci heteu lu maisia.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Dede mina da rabe la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">keringria keteube Ngkiengtube Tinggwang ne pecu kecikecet pwapeu.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Mina kedime ge de rünne maci lie la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">mede mina hecingkedime rünne ma kemzuibe de ci swa lu la ma.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Cine Ih nda ge rangla, ‘A kwa kingnei lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">Ih cikelu maci de nda ge rang lia zie.’<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Pielo, Ih n samdung de kwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">Ih nnui kesamlim kebam kwadung kingnei bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">nang daipai rang zie bi de cet kebam dau.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Kesang, Ih ncu piegai bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">dede, pielo, cika mige de Job lungteinreu lu kera gah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">mede pe samdung keli gai kera.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />‘Anui maci ngau luda!’ de rang kelakne mriak lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Tinggwang ne Job reu ngkieng luzie; mina ne cide tei gai lak.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Iciu eh Job pe samdung rang pwa acu mmau ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">cine nnui samdung dele keu Ih pe sam keli lak.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Mina aipau hangcum de penui sam gadi; penui Job de keli si gai lakdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">penui magede de rang si gai kera gadi.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Penui mlei mene kebam de Ih kwa bam mai sia ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">kedanemene penui luga zing de sap nah sam de keli si mene?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Lak, Ih de alam bie de sam keli zie da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">Ih de cikelube penui dage rang gai zie.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Iciu eh samdung acu pui bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">rabe a lungga kebam dene acu kecung gai.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Pielo, a hekarak au zaucing cide mpet kebam nzwa da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">zauladung keheci nzwa, cide pangpop di kera mtei luda.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Ih marang zie iciude Ih ngkieng dai lubui lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">Ih a muileu kenana ngkei gai zie nah sam kelizie.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Ih heneuherüt keu lia lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">meliene mikeheibe de de ngaukehing zidung de peu lak.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Kedanemene Ih cikenzwa be zidung de dainzwa ha zie bi ci melu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">magade Ih cide tei cai, Damkegaibe tiemene acu ngngwa tetdi zie lu.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Cine cu, Job, Ih ndade a nggia kiela, Ih kerang de siu lo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">a samdung de kingnei lo.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Pielo cu, Ih a mui ngkei dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">a mleu a mui gade samrang bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />A samdung a nlung kemzuibe gade gwangla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">a muileukung maci kesangbe rangla.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Tinggwang Rabe ne damgai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">Ngkiengtube kering ngicui acu kai pwapeu.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Nang teilu bui cai, acu keli gai lo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">a dwa ga cusap lwe n samdung rang teune gailo.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Pielo, Tinggwang miakngau gade Ih ncu hengin lie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">Ih liede tangdei le acu tei kelume ge.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Pielo, kengngidung ncu tei pwapeu ncu peu mahing dilak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">mede ncu hing kera kerüt n peu ga gwang dilak.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Nang a kwen gage kesangbe ranggai da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">Ih n samrang kwadung siu da,<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‘Ih au mci nah kemau ada gah;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">acu mmau gai kera ga, nah ada makesia ketei ga.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Pielo, Tinggwang acu gwaketang kera lampui peila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">pa acu le pe ngauraume lie bam dida.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Pa a pi pwa pidau gage kai gai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">pa a lampuidung pelane piebam la.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Pielo, aika de nang petau meda, Ih ncu keli gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">kedanemene Tinggwang au mina swade di ki.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Nang daitei pecu ncam eh mmau la no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">Pa pe bata hadung kette kaigai lama.<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Cine Tinggwang piage rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">yeo, piana, ciude mina cide cilu ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Mimang gade, tingmui mangdak gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">mina zipzing de kezeu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">zeulie ga zip yisüt kebam dau,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />cidau Tinggwang minadung kwen ngkei gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">nah penui de ledeu kegai de kebai dila,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />cide mina dage teigai zielie kebam penui kemau ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">nah ngang kecu kebai di kela ziemne.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Tinggwang hekwaki gade mina teilung teu cailigwang luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">pe teilung ketsai gade lüt di lai eh kebam gade kelilu da.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Mina de pe zeu gade keteeikenei kai eh ledeu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">pera gage matei kehung liagai kelak kai la,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />iciu eh pe teilung au ketyeipuk tyei neu tadi zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">nah pe rabe taktyei de nggum tadi la.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Pe pumteih ga peci gah dila ciu eh cide ngau gailak dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">pe radung, ndaa ngaula kemak de, cu ngau pet dizie.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Kesang, pe rabe perau ga nna gwangla da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">pe keringria matei ngkap keladung nna jütjüt gwang lada.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Dede magade tinggimgwame ge pecu ngha kera cika bam cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">cangcang gade ket,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">mina de pe ziemne dai petau bi rang beulu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Tinggwang pecu ngaunggia beu zie delwe pedage ranglo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Pecu peu herau gade kelibeu lo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">Ih pecu rilu kera ge ngaulu delu.’<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Iciu eh pe pum ga pe teih henamedung teih swade nciep gwa dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">pa perehang tingdau ga cailigwang dai dizie.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Pa Tinggwang dade kie zie, nah Tinggwang pecu ngaunggia zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">iciu eh penui suiyi süt eh Tinggwang de ngau zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">Tinggwang pe minadung dage kesamsang ziehi peu zie.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Pecai cipaude lei tei zie mina kedame dwa gade nah rang eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Ih mau dida nah kemzuibe de gi dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">dede a mau de ziemne saja peu ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Tinggwang a rabe de hekwakecok ga lütdi kera gade kelibeu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">a teilung kebaa ngau jüja bam dizie.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Pielo, Tinggwang ma aidung pelane mina ge de ngngwa tei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">piana, yeo, pia pekecumbe de,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />herau gade pe keringria teugwang dai luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">iciu eh pe teilung keringria keba de peu pecu gi mbaa lu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Pie teune lu, Job, nah a kwa kingnei lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">zing de bamlu nah Ih marang gai zie.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Magade nang madungge rangneu bam cai, acu keligai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">ranggailo, kedanemene Ih ncu peu petau siakpe ga bamneu lie.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ciciu meliecai, iciu cai a kwa kingnei lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">zingde bamlu, nah Ih maci teu eh ncu ledeu beu zie.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Cipaureude, Elihu rangsi eh:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“A samdung kingnei gailo, nnui makecime;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">a kwa kingneilu, nnui kecikecet kebame.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Kedanemene mikwen au kingnei lalu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">mingangak ketyeipok nsi kela nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Anui ziemne anui kenzuibe kedet lugo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">anui ziemne ma keyibe anui ci lugo.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Job ranggai da, ‘I au masang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">dede Tinggwang a nzeudung keugi dida.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />A nzeudung pei mene, acu le kenretpe tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">A jamdung yi pa dida, Ih kemau bam melie de.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Mina caube Job nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">dui nzwa kecwasam sak eh.<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Kesia keteime de nzwa eh nrui twagwa beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">na kesia keteime de ngngwa tetla kela?<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Pa rang kedine, ‘Tinggwang luuneu kelabe tei kelame ge magede teikelu gah.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />A kwa kingnei gailo, nnui kecikecetme:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Tinggwang hetakesia tei kera au pe dade mdei dilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Ngkiengtube kemauta tei kera au pe dade mdei dilu.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Pa au mide bata nzwa peudai lalu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">pa mileune de pe lampui riep ga kela nzwa pe ziehi pwa lula.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Kesang Tinggwang kesia ta gede tei lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Ngkiengtube au kenzuibe tei msiadi lama.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Caune pecu kideu reu keteube teibeu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Caune hangdeu pelane keu pe kang gage kai beu no?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Pa magade pe macetdung pe ziemne rünne tei cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">nah magade pa pe rabe nah pe cuingi pe dage kekwapwa dai di cai,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />Iciucai mina pelane kapciau dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">mina leune rebui ga cailigwang dizie.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Nnui cu kecikecet bamcai, aide kingnei gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">a samdung kwa kingnei gailo.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Kenzuibe ngkau kelame mireu di lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Nnui Tinggwang mmau zie ni, kesamsang nah kengkiengbe de?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Tinggwang, hegwangpei ge dage rangla ni, ‘Nang au sia,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">mede keyime dage ‘Nang au nlien’?<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Tinggwang, muiteume dage heneuherüt lia lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">nah kegahme de swa keheime de rang hemi swa lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">penui pelane de pe bata ciau kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mac: 22:2, Rom: 2:11, Jam: 2:1</char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Penui kaknage gage tsai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">muisum dau keheu dizie nah tsai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Kengkingme de keuteu dizie, dede mina ba ne la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">pa laka eh kengking mede teitsetlula.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Tinggwang miak au mige lampui ga piela;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">pa pikiet pelane ngaula.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Kemui gah, rahang mwa gah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">kemau keteime mbai lu kera bam.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Tinggwang au mige de mcet si mede yi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">Migede tutiak ziemne pe dwa ga gwang mede yi.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Pa kengkiengme de teikecai dila penui teilung ha keteuketing si mede keyime de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">pa kedame de penui bamdung gage kai dila.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Ainzwa eh pa penui tadung ha cibam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">pa tingmui mina aidungde keliengi dila, penuide ngkap dila.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Minadung kengau gade, pa penuide kemaume de nzwa penui ta kesiane teitset dila<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Kedanemene penui pecai sui gade nreu tet kedine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">nah pe lampuidung keheibe ci kemak nzwa kedine.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Ainzwa eh, penui kegahme mra kwa peu pe da gwanglu la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">pa keherei kelame mra kwa siu luda.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Pa mlei ta kedi dau, cau pecu mmau lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Pa pe zu hebai di cai, cau pecu ci lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Pa au heleuhbe nah nlibe reuga nzwakap eh dila,<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />iciu eh mina kesiame ne kedi tei melu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">iciu eh minadung tak tei kerane migede bam melu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Magade mige Tinggwang dage rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Ih mau kesang dida, dede Ih kemau tei lak ta;<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Ih ngau kelakbe acu ledeu beulo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">Ih kemau tei dida, dede Ih cide teisi lakta.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Nnui cipaude mau ziemne pecu saja peu kera cet la ni, nnui Tinggwang tei kelade nnui sui lame kecune?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Nnui kedet la maisia Ih be mene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Cine nnui kecibe ranggai lo.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Kecikecetme a da rangla zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">kesang, a kwa kesiu kemriakme leune rang zie,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Job au kecikecet si mene marang la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">pe samdung au maci si ma.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Magade Job de pe ha keceu kecak ziemne tutiak gage kai cai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">kenlienme nzwa kerang sam ziemne.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Pa pe mau gage kecamlai kaisi kelune;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">pa anui kakga nuineu eh bapeu kecune;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">pa Tinggwang de kemmau samdung keswa luda.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Elihu rangsi eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Nang aide nzeulie nang cetla ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">nang ‘Tinggwang dwa gade a nzeu’ de eh rang kegai dau?<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Nang keteu lalu, ‘A ziemne cide daipai ge no?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">Nah ‘Ih kemmau tei de cai Ih yiki zie ni?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Ih n sam keli beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">n sam nah n zangme samdung.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Tingkam ga pie gailo, cide ngau gailo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">tingkam pielu, cide n swa huki.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Nang kemau tei dida, nang Tinggwang dage kerehim daipai teigai la no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">N kemaudung hekwa hu lucai, nang pe dage daipai teigai no?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Nang au masang lie cai, nang pecu daipai peulu lai no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">Pa n ba gade daipai luu lulai no?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />N siet ne migede rejam lubui, nang au mina ge kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">nah n kesamsang ne mina kangge de keyi peu lubui. <verse eid="JOB 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Mide teikeherei ta kekiee ge ziemne, minadung sah gaila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">penui kengkiengme ba gade kengha kie gai.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Dede migede rang ma, ‘Daiga acu Teikegaibe Tinggwang la no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">tingmui leidung peu kelabe,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />kideu ga makaunedung de swade anuide ledeu kieeki beu kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">nah anuide tinggim ruinedung swade anuide maci teingkiee beu kelabe?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Cikade penui sah gai, dede Tinggwang samli peu ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">kedanemene kemaume penui zaidi kedine.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Tinggwang au kemieme sah kegai kingnei lak kesang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">nah Ngkiengtube cide ga pelung kailak.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Nang pecu ngau melie rang cai pa dainkenzwa ge de n sam keli cam zie no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">n ha au pe dwaga bamlie kecude, nah nang pecu kwa bamdi kecude!<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Nang au pe rata au mide saja peula melie cu rangbam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">nah kemau de keceunage kecang de pa au piela melie zeu.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Cine Job kemiesam rang kera rünne ziemne pemui ngnga cula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">pa kecikecet si mene samdung keswapui luda.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu rangsi eh ranggai,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Peu acu manage rangsi gailo, iciude Ih nnui dage madung ge ranglia zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">kedanemene Ih Tinggwang lamgum eh kie kemak ge rang kera bamreu kecune.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Ih kemdei gade a kecikecet teugwang luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">Kesamsang au acu Teikegaibe da bam lie kecu Ih rang zie.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Kesangbe, a samdung au kenretbe lak lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">nnui swa kecikecet kengkieng kebamme ge nnuide ngngwa bamlie.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Pielo, Tinggwang au ngkieng, nah migede de mlai lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">pa au kecikecet kengkieng di süt.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Pa mina kenlienme teilung gangbeu lama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">dede keherei kelame ziemne daipai nzeubi tei beula.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Pa masang kecume dade pe miak nreudi lama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">dede penuide hegwangpeidung de nzwa kelungta hegwangbam reu gage kai lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">nah penuide teuncuh hu beula.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Penuide hegeuria le kang dicai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">nah keherei ria gage keulu cai,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />iciucai pa penuide tei kedibe liagai beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">nah penui maudung nah penui ngang kelade.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Pa penui kwen de ngkei pwa pe keledeusam gage kai lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">nah penui mau gade nreu caili lulo aja kaibeu la.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Penui pekwa kingnei lwe pecu reca luge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">penui au penui tingbazie lungh yi eh penui ting nggwang luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">penui mmidung mnung eh.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Dede, penui kingnei mecai, penui kiengtie gade tsai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">penui tsai zie penui kecikecet kegah ne.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Mina kesiame penui rata penui mlung gage kekwa lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">Tinggwang penuide kanglu liede penui kengha kie eh sahgai lama.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Penui hena daude tsai dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">penui kerecaki helipeidung kakgade penui teilung penli dila.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Tinggwang au keherei kelame de penui reidung gade keli lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">pa penui rei gade penui kwendung teimrak beula.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Kesang, pa nnuide keherei gade teumpet beu neula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">keherei kegah heni kemza gage ni gage kai beu da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">nah n taktyeibam teihca kepui kaipwa kebam ga.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Dede nnui au kesiame de kemmau le kepui tei bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">tutiak nah kenzeu ne nnuide kerak lula.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Peu n rata de mide teu henui ketei gage nnuide kemeu gai diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">mede hesuheri kedi gede peu ncu teukereu diso.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />N mahei ncu keyi peu lubui mi, iciu eh nang keherei ga lüt di melu kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">mede n kengkieng pelane ncu ngha lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Tingmui de regui so, kedame de renia eh kemau tei kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">minadung de penui bam gade bikau dige.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Nnui kemau gage nreugai melu kera mriak lulo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">kedanemene nnui kemau gade nreu lu kelane nnuide kedei bam kecune.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Pielo, Tinggwang au kengkieng gade hu eh bamlie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">keledeu ge cau pa nzwa no?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Caune pecu pe lampui ledeu lia beu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">Cauge pe dage ranglu bui no, ‘Nang kemau tei dida?’<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Pe batadung twa kera nsung lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">mina cide lei tei bam kelade.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Mina pelane bata cidung de pie bamla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">dede penui bata cidungde kemdei gade ngau bamla.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Pielo, Tinggwang au dizu, dede anui pecu ci mmi lu lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">pe mmidung au peikap kelu gah.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Pa tingleidung teucuh lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">cide cui gade pa tingrui lie eh teimci gaila,<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />hemwadung rui mie beu kelade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">nah mina leune reuga kie süt eh zau kemie de.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Kesang, mina keheibe de hemwa himpui kebam de cilu bui ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">nah pe ki gade tingceu de?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Pielo, pa pe kebaa kempik de pecu tei twagwapung kebam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">nah jaaidi mahdung gumpung kebam.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Ainzwa eh minadung tutiak la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">nah ketyeipok kepui peula.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Pa ting kehepik le pe ba pui bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">pa cide de kahpwa kebam de kedeu gailo aja peu kemakta.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Tingceu cide heratingkai gwang kera ranglia beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">kauruine de cide kegwang kwa siu lubui.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Kesang, aide ne a mlung mbeu dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">cide pe bam gade mlai mpet dila.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Kingneilu, oh, pe kwa siu lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">pe mui gade kepet kwa de.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Pa cide tingkam pelane kang gage lang mpet gaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">nah pa pegu tingkehepik de kideube kung gage lang mpet gaila.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Makwa ge cide caisui eh mra gaila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">pa pe kendu kwa teu eh tingceu gaila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">pe kwa siu keludau pa hegi kekei de kam dila ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Tinggwang pe kwa miswakega tingceu kwa nzwa gaila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">pa anui ci cang gai kelak tadung tei gaila.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Pa buising dage rangla, ‘Kideu ga cak mie lu’;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">tingrui dage de cinzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">‘Tingrui kedi ge teilu.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Pa mina pelane heta tei kela gade penui ta teimtak dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">iciu eh pa ne tei kegai mina leune pe batadung ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Pecai teikuudung pak mbai dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">nah penui kidung ga bam dila.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Rahang pe ki ngkangle de gwangla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">nah kengkung nreule tingkai zang kela gade gwangla.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Tinggwang cuingi ne buising peu la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">dui teukampwa kebam de hegeu nzwa tak dila.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Kesang, pe hemwa dui siusung eh kebam de teicak gaila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">pa pegu tingkepik de hemwa gade teizang gaila.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Pa pe puisau gade hemwadung de teu twagwa gaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">iciu eh cidungde penuide teilu lo kecube teilu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">kideu pelane reu ga.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Pa ma aidungde pelane tei gaila; cide madauge tei mzui lu kerane, madauge pe deu ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">nah madauge samkak kelu masang tadung tei eh.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Aide kingnei lu, Job;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">mtak lwe Tinggwang bata miswakegahdung cet gailo.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Nang cimi Tinggwang dainzwa hemwadung teilu bi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">nah hegikekei de peu cidung kakga baa kelu?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Nang hemwadung him kela cimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">miswakegah Tinggwang bata dung, kecikecet yicang kecube?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Dainzwa eh n paini lumdi labi nang cimi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">tingkai ngkangle de kegwang dau kideube zing dedi kelade?<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Pa tei kelu nzwa eh nang tingkam teukam lubui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">tingkam, hegeu teitak kelu miakpiebung nzwa ngkieng kebam de kengkieng de?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Anui pe dage dai rang ziebi anuide ledeu beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">anui lung mui kedine anui rang kera samdung telei daulak delu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Ih pecu mpau neu la lie kecu pe dage rangria maisia ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Mige pecu peu mneu luneu la ni?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Cu, minadung tingnaimiak tingkam ga baa kebam dau pie daulak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">tingkai cide kahgwang eh hemwadung teimci kedi dau.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Tingpeule de kecak zuyi gwangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Tinggwang da au ngaukehing kendu la lie.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Ngkiengtube ziemne au, anui pecu peei gailak!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">Pa au kengkieng gah dizie lie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">Pa au kenzeube de teikeherei lama nah makesang ga pui bam la.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Cine, minadung pecu hing lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">Pa au mina penui lungning mteu lie kelame de magede pelung kai la melie.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">RAMPAUBE</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Pecai RAMPAUBE rahang keci ge gade Job de qu eh rangdi,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Kecikecet si mene marang eh tariem gage kemui teugwang kela aide cau no?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Cu mipei ge nzwa n kiakang ngkang lu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mteilu </char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">kedanemene Ih ncu keheteudung ge keteu zielu, nah nang a sam keli maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:7">Job 40:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Ih kideu bangbeu dwa kebam dau nang daiga lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">A dage ranggai, nang kecikecet keibam lie cai.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Caune cide cet mning luno? Ranggai lo nang ci cai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Caune cide reuga kemdet ria kezang gai no?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Cide bangbeu daipai reu gage dwa luno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Caune cide kimiaktsu dwa luno?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Tingcang gidung ngngwa lei ketei dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">nah Tinggwang namedung suiyi kwa sah kegai dau?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Caune jaaidi kikamdung ngkui di no</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">cide pangpop kepet dau, cide neki ge gade kepet dau nzwa,<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Ih hemwa painidung ketei dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">nah muiting kecu cide kezui pwa kebam dau?<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Cidau Ih jaaidi ziemne a hedeurai rietlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">nah Ih cide kebam nah kikamdung kai keludau,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />nah Ih cide dage kerang dau, ‘Nang aika kecang gwang lubui, dede mdei silak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">aika ge Ih n duicui ngang keladung rai ge kai beuzie.’<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Nang tingcang dage aja kai ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">mede tingcang baareirang de pebam cilu kera teibeu ni,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />iciude cide kideube nlidung giepwa bamlu kera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">nah kenlienme de cikade kecung mpet di kera?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Kideube au pe rehi lidi lidei au giakdap kang gade lidi kela nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">cipau reuga ma pelane pai ge kedip kenzeu ge nzwa mcigi eh sap bam.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Kenlienme dade penui ‘kebaa’ de keugi di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">penui ba hwa kenzeu de teicum di.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Nang jaaidi rwakdung ga mie deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">Nang kecok coktu lebie mie deni?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Ketsai riekidung de ncu keulia deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">Nang ketsai mie riekidung ngau deni?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Nang kideube petie pedi cibam deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">A dage ranggai lo, nang cidung pelane ci bam cai.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Kebaa mtakbam daiga bam no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">kemuibe, daiga pebam no?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Nang kebaa nah kemui de cide kena ta bam ga nzangmie lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">Nang ci kenade penai ki ga cailigwang lampui peei lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Nang cibam cika, cidau ncu mna lu delu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">n tingbaziedung au kiee zu lie!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Nang buising kidung ga lütpie deni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">mede nang tangheu kidung ngau deni,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ma aidung de Ih keherei tingdau ziemne kai pwa kebam de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">reutak nah keregi tingdau ziemne?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Hegi keikemie mzi gaibeu kera lampui daide no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">Mede naimiak kepetle de kideu reu dai gage tingkai teizang la no?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Caune duidi tingrui helau teigai beu no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">mede caune tingkeceu lampui teigai beu no,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />migede lungla kemak deudung ga ting teirui gai no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">nah hetaideu, migede kegah ga,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />teimsia kedi nah gikedi nidung de peu mnunglu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">nah peu kideube de cehei lungpet lu kera?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Tingrui pe pei ge bam ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">mede caune hezin pei tei bam no?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Caube henabam gade buising gwang no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">Caune tingkam gade hesiuli mpet no?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Duidung mbai lwe tangtsu nzwadi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">kideu kecok ngkung pekang mmi di.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Nang Tialiangkileime de kanglu bui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">mede Orion ria teicak lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Nang hegisaudung de peting saikdau baapet lulo saubeu lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">Nang Ghibei nah Heghikamca lampui sau beulu buini?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Nang tingkam nlaidung ci ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">Nang kideu reu gage tingkam zaidung kaibeu lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Nang hemwadung gade marang lubui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">iciu eh tingruidui kekiee ge ncu gumlu kera?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Nang hegi keimie lu kera cidung de lang mpet gai lubui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">cidung n dage rang lubui ni, ‘Anui aika bam’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Caune hemwa gage maci kai no</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">mede hezin de kecikecet peu no?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Caune pe maci le hemwadung peeikap lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">Caune tingkam duiladung rui mpet lulai<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />rebuidung ma ketak be ga pak kelwet dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">nah kideu kangdung rekaubing kelu dau?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Nang hingho pui ge tuilu bui ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">mede hingho nadung kenzeu teimnung lubui ni<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />Penui ki ga mbai kebam dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">nah kwa eh mbai kebam dau?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Caune nruine pok teibeu lano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">pe namedung Tinggwang dage mra kegai dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">nah ketyeipok gah eh tanglia kela dau?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Daidau ting tsura ga renaam meudung mciu labi nang ci ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">Daidau ting heti pe na mciu labi nang kwalu bui ni?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Penui tetlak kecu keidung nang pei lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">Nang penui na kemna ting ci bam ni?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Penui ndünmie penui na mna lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">iciu eh penui kemna tet tei ting cang dila.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Penui namedung ngkienglu nah renaam gade dicu lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">penui hegwale pet eh cailigwang dai tadi la.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Caune peu renaam gada de lungmpet beu lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Caune pak kenzet gadadung ria hiak gai beu no,<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Cidung de ki Ih Arabah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hetaideu</char></note> gage tei pwabam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">pe ki mcai deu gage?<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Pa namdi ga makwadung siu eh rata gade nuila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">pa kehereube kesah kwadung siu lama.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Pa lamlwadung ga pe taktyei ga terwa la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">pa rebang kemdiak leune tyei kera pie la.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Hetumseu n ta tei kera pesui yi zieni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Pa n kauruine ki ga bam neu zieni?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Nang renaam tumseu hepei kepung ria teulu bui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Pa langkam de puhlu buini pa ncai sui eh?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Pa kengkieng kedi de nang nlumlu bui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">Nang n ta de pecu peu tei kera püt beulu buini?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />N ciu kilung punggwang kera nang pecu nlum lubui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">n caipung ziemne meiciu hekwa kera?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Ruitie hegie eh siulap gaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">dede cide hegeuring nah hunglu kebui maidung ge ni?<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Kedanemene pa pe bum kideu gage nbum gaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">nah cidungde peu rebui ga lumbam lula;<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />pa cidungde hepi ne daupop di kera nsungta dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">mede teikuu ge ne cidung caidi kera.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Pe name de pena kemak nzwa dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">pa pe bata de kapdi kera hing lama,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Tinggwang pe dade maci keugi kedine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">nah pecu kecikecet gede peu kemakne.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Pa pak nzet kegai dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">pa hekwen nah cide keteube de nuineu dila.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Nang ne hekwen de pe kengkieng peu ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">Nang ne pe maiketie pwa pe ngwang pai tei beuni?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Nang pecu tangrim ge nzwa nsau lu kera tei gai ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">Pe ngidiketeu kwa kedi de au kehing ge.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Pa ngkieng eh pakpet la nah pe kengkieng teu pe sui yila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">pa hereunet de redau kerane pakpet la.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Pa kengngi de nuineu la nah nggi di lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">pa kingtie gade caili di lama.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Pegim mlai kezang mbeu gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">kepiklik kebam hengei nah kehiatie si eh.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Pa kekuu nah rata si eh hangdeu mneu lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">telui kwa kegaidau, pa heni ket ga sap gailak.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Telui kwa kegai dau, pa rangla, ‘Aha!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">Pa kemdei gade hereu riem ci lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">reugwa muibedung sahbak kegai na sahkegai kwadung.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />N maci ziemne helie limhu lula ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">pa tingpile pe hesiu kezang kegai de?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />N aja gade lingrie limcu cehu la ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">nah heni kecehudung ga pecit teu lani?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Pa hetialwa ga lungh eh pe ki tei lula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">tsuratia peu gage, kengkieng gage.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Aika de pa pe taktyei peei la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">pe miak au kemdei gade cidung ngaula.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Pe name de hejai sak lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">ketsai pau kebam ga, pa de cika bamla.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat: 24:28, Luk 17:37</char></note><verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />RAMPAUBE Job dage rangsi eh cu,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Mide kii neu eh kelame Ngkiengtube de teinzui lu bui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Tinggwang de samlim kelame de peu rang gailo.”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Pecai Job au RAMPAUBE sam keli eh cu,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Pielo, Ih au magede ma; Ih dainzwa n sam keli lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Ih a bale a mui keba luda.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Ih pia ge rang dida, nah Ih sam keli lakta;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">kesangbe, piana, dede Ih au sipet lakta.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Pecai RAMPAUBE au Job sam keli eh rahang keci ge gade marang,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Cu au mina ge nzwa n kia kanglu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">kedanemene Ih ncu keteu zie, nah nang a sam keli maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">Job 38:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Ih au kesangbe masang me lie kecu nang rangzie ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">Nang au acu mmau zie ni iciu eh nangbe petau lie lu kera?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Nang Tinggwang ba nzwa bam ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">N pa nzwa eh pe kwa nzwa tingceu kwa teilu bui ni?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Cu nang kendu nah herüt teubah lulo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">herüt nah kengkieng pwa kailu.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />N rata süt kedide teizang gidi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">ngang kelame de teihenah kedi leune de pie gailo.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Ngang kelame leude teihenah kedi pie gailo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">penui sap gade kenlienme de caikau kedi.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Kideu kang gage penuide kung kecüt kedi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">penui zudung kemui gage kebai kedi.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Iciude Ih de n ha ranggai zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">n ba zetle ncu kelilu bui lie kecu.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Cu teikuu de pie gailo, Ih ncu tei kelu dau cide tei kelude;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">pa au ketumseu ge nzwa cehei tyeila.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Cu pielo, pe kengkieng au pe kiakang ga lalie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">pe kengkieng au pe za cih ga lalie.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Pa pe mi cedartsing nzwa tei lula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">pe mnie riadung au teukecüt lwe bam.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Pe radung au hetageu lwadung nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">pe pi au hegeu tiedung nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Pa au Tinggwang damkegai kaunedung reu kedibe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">Tinggwang pecu teikegaibe rünne pecu ngam lubui.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Kedanemene kideutudung pe taktyei pwa peula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">renaam ga teikuudung pe tai ga nggwa bamla.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Pa lotus bang kang ga zeu bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">hekuubangdung sung kangga, dui kehwa ga.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Lotus pabangdung penui sung gage pecu gumpung bamla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">reuceuna taiga willowbangdung pecu sung bamla.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Pielo, hereuki ge pekung ga pui dicai, pa mbeu lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">pa au kuu bam, Jordan pe mui ga puihang liede.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Keheibe de kagwakle pecu tui lubui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">mede kekuitie ge teu pe ngkie kuitiet lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Nang kagwak le Leviathan de teumpet lu bui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Mede heria ge le pe geijara kanglu bui ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Nang pe ngkie gage heria ge kailu bui ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">mede kagwak le pe geija kai lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Pa n dage pe nggia kekie rang zie ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Pa n dade samkenciep rang zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Pa ncu ngngwa samkak tei zie ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">nang pecu teu n kila ge tei lamui kera?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Nang nruinne ge de nzwa pecu ngngwa zie ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">N kilapuidung ziemne nang pecu kanglu zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Heka ketuime maadung pe ziemne helilia zie ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">Heliketeime helitei kera pecu rak mzi zie ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Nang pe geu hengei le kuipui lubui ni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">mede heka ketuitiedung teu pe peu kuipui lubui ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Pe reu gage piage n ba kaipie lo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">iciude nang reutak de ci luzie nah cide teisi lak.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Pielo, cide tei kelame keregui au kenret ge lie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">Pecu ngau kegaile de keheibe de de hangdeu gage keliengai di lak ni?<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Pa Leviathan de kera neu kegai swa magede hing kecu galie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">cau ciucai, a dwaga sap lubui no?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Ih pecu peu dai kera cau ge acu peu raipwa bam no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">Tingkam kangga kela pelane leune agu lie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:35">Rom. 11:35</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 11:36">36</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Ih Leviathan pi ha mlei mene bamlak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">mede pe kengkieng ha, mede pe zuyi de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:25">Ken. 1:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Caune pe pum cum de rampet lu lai no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">Caune pe reunetdung kuitiet lu lai no?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Caune pe zu kikamdung let lu lai no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">pe geidung riapung bam, cidung au ngauhing kecuge?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Pe gim au pelip riadung le teipwa bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">kaugiak ge nzwa kang kecüt lu eh.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Ket au kedage taiga mna bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">iciu eh pekak ga tingkai lüt gailak lu kera.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Cidung de ket ket de keu ncüt pwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">cidung riangkeu bam, iciu eh cidung de riaumpet lu kelak ne.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Pa ngiditeu kegai gade kebaa baapet la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">pe miak au tingcang nuge miakkum nzwa lie.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Pe mui gade miheu petla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">mitsi heu pet la,<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Pe ngkieki gade mika petla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">duili kang mi ga hekuu heu kebam mika nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Pe cuingi ne regeu teiheu dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">pe mui gade mi petla.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Pe ngwang ga kengkieng bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">nah pe dwaga ngaukehing helim lim bam.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Pe ci lipdung au kedip kecüt pwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">cidung au pe da ntip süt bam; cidungde deukelai gailak.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Pe mlung au tangtsu ge nzwa tak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">kesang, kegimtsu nkangbe de nzwa tak.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Pa cuh kegai dau, herabedung de ngngi dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">kengngi ziemne, penui caisim dila.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Kingtie ge pecu bi cai, cide magede teilu lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">nah hengei ge liede, lakpitsi ge, mede pemui kenzau keheibe de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:21-24">Job 39:21-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Pa au hegeu de reigau nzwa lie cet la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">nah hetageu au tsingrim nzwa lie eh.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Lakpitsi ge pecu peu pak gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">pe ziemne tamnung tsukang au ciurie nzwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Tsingrang au reigau nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">pa hengei hia kegaide nuineu dila.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Pe pum ngkangle au li pang kedi kenzaube nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">pa tsingdaptie nzwa nyasai ga pecai niazangra eh kebam tei dila.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Pa duikecok teipwa tarum eh li ge ga dui kenswak nzwa dila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">pa jaaidi teipwa maca li ge nzwa dila.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Pa pecai ga kebaa ge teigai la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">duikecok de peu pu lie cetlu kebui ge dila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:30">Job 38:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Kideu ga pecu kedalu kera bam ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">peu ngngi mene lunghlu kera teibeu.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Pa ngang kela leune ngaula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">pa au ngang kelame pelane gwangpei.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s">Job</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Pecai Job RAMPAUBE sam keli eh cu,<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Nang maleune teilu kebui Ih ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">nang riem kegaide kamgai kelak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mac: 19:21, Isa: 14:27, Mar: 10:27</char></note><verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />‘Cau no aide kecikecet bam mene mariem gai kela?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Kesang, Ih ci kemakbe de rang dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">a ziemne cipa ham kecube, Ih ci kemakbe.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Nang a dage rang, ‘Kingnei lu, cu, Ih marang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">Ih nnuide ma keteu zie, nah nnui a dage rang beuzie.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Ih a kwen le n kwa siu luda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">dede cu au a miak le ncu ngaubam dida.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Cine Ih acu mlai dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">Ih rebui nah mimüt gade a lung nreulu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Pa Job dage Temanme pei Eliphaz dage rangdi, “A rata au ncu nah nzangbe kena da heu bam dida, nnui au a ha petaube rang kemakne, a kilabe Job tei kegai nzwa eh. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Cu, cine, nnui ziemne hetumseu hena, meurünseu hena, delwe a kilabe Job da keru reca ge teigai lu. A kilabe Job nnui ziemne kekie tei zie, nang Ih pe kekie kingnei luzie, iciu eh Ih nnuide nnui kemie nzwa hengam teidi melu kerane. Nnui au a ha petaube rang ma, a kilabe Job kerang nzwa eh.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Cine Temanme pei Eliphaz, Shuahme Bildad, nah Naamahme Zophar pecu mie delwe RAMPAUBE penuide rang kebeu nzwa teilu, nah RAMPAUBE Job kekie de luu lu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Job pe zangmedung kekiee teigai, RAMPAUBE madung teu cuh dai beu. RAMPAUBE pecu ndaa mabam kena kiee ge peu. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Pecai Job siname pelane, nah pe timedung, nah ndaa pecu kecime pelane pe da gwanglu delwe pe ki ga pecu ngngwa matyei lu. Penui pecu kenggia liagai nah Tinggwang ne pe reu gage keherei teugwang kegai leune ziemne pelung teinciep gai, nah penui pelane hangge ge kecu Job de rangkanggeu ket nah kecak ring ket ramcau peugai. <verse eid="JOB 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />RAMPAUBE au Job teilung kerai dau swade kekamle samlam peu kiee gai, pa meurün cang kereiemdai, ut cang herok, hetumseu cang ge, nah gadapuidung cang ge bam. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Pa pe napei hena nah pe napui hangcum bam. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Pa pe napui cingtube pui zi Jemimah, kenabe Keziah, nah kecumbe Keren-Happuch de qulu. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Kideu pelane gade Job napuidung kenzwa hezukeyi ngau ma. Penui pei penui heime de si eh magum peugai. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Aide cai, Job mmi 140 lunghlu; pa pe napeidung nah tsamedung ceheu mdai kecang ngaulu. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Pecai Job cing di nah tingbazie kepui tei eh.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>